(621216, 64651, 14986, '<td valign="top">Like the black and white here.   I also like the gaze going out of the frame.  This is my favorite so far.</td>', 'Like the black and white here.   I also like the gaze going out of the frame.  This is my favorite so far.', '2004-03-15 01:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(621217, 64036, 5475, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like heavily photoshopped images, but this one has a wonderful magical quality to it.  It is a wonderful image to begin with, and your colorful rendition is very fun and appealing.  Don''t be discouraged if you get lower votes from the ''purists''...  This is a real treasure!<br/>JD</td>', 'I don''t usually like heavily photoshopped images, but this one has a wonderful magical quality to it.  It is a wonderful image to begin with, and your colorful rendition is very fun and appealing.  Don''t be discouraged if you get lower votes from the ''purists''...  This is a real treasure!JD', '2004-03-15 01:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(621218, 64523, 14986, '<td valign="top">A fun shot, but I''m not crazy abou the angle.</td>', 'A fun shot, but I''m not crazy abou the angle.', '2004-03-15 01:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(621219, 64607, 14986, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred her looking at the camera. Colors and focus are nice.</td>', 'I would have preferred her looking at the camera. Colors and focus are nice.', '2004-03-15 01:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(621221, 64181, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great example of a nicely done traditional shot.  I like the choice of the tones here too.</td>', 'I think this is a great example of a nicely done traditional shot.  I like the choice of the tones here too.', '2004-03-15 01:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(621222, 64639, 5475, '<td valign="top">This is really fun!  His expression is great (I have three boys and know that expression well).  It gets a 9 from me.  It would have been a 10 except for two minor flaws...  Thiere is a slight shadow to the left, and his toes are cut off at the bottom.  Very minor issues, as this is a great image!<br/>JD</td>', 'This is really fun!  His expression is great (I have three boys and know that expression well).  It gets a 9 from me.  It would have been a 10 except for two minor flaws...  Thiere is a slight shadow to the left, and his toes are cut off at the bottom.  Very minor issues, as this is a great image!JD', '2004-03-15 01:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(621224, 64451, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  I think it''s nice to have some aspect of the person''s interests or personality in the portrait.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  I think it''s nice to have some aspect of the person''s interests or personality in the portrait.', '2004-03-15 01:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(621225, 64451, 16818, '<td valign="top">Great Shot! It might of been better without the yellow light on the right side. It takes your eyes away from the subject.</td>', 'Great Shot! It might of been better without the yellow light on the right side. It takes your eyes away from the subject.', '2004-03-15 01:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(621226, 64036, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like that pose a lot.  I also like the effects, but I hope you''ll post the original after the challenge.</td>', 'I like that pose a lot.  I also like the effects, but I hope you''ll post the original after the challenge.', '2004-03-15 01:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(621227, 64481, 14986, '<td valign="top">I would have like this cropped a little tighter left and right.  I love the richness of the colors.</td>', 'I would have like this cropped a little tighter left and right.  I love the richness of the colors.', '2004-03-15 01:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(621228, 64463, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is the stuff nightmares are made of!  Nicely shot, however!</td>', 'This is the stuff nightmares are made of!  Nicely shot, however!', '2004-03-15 01:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(621229, 64574, 14986, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the pose or the lighting.  The dark shadows under the chin against the pale skin is too contrasty.  I would have cropped a little more off the left side.</td>', 'I don''t care for the pose or the lighting.  The dark shadows under the chin against the pale skin is too contrasty.  I would have cropped a little more off the left side.', '2004-03-15 01:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(621230, 64275, 14986, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is a flattering portrait pose.  The focal point seems to be her ear!</td>', 'I don''t think this is a flattering portrait pose.  The focal point seems to be her ear!', '2004-03-15 01:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(621231, 64635, 14986, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the heavy shadow on his face.  The tones seem a little too bright to me.  I like the character and the pose.</td>', 'Too bad about the heavy shadow on his face.  The tones seem a little too bright to me.  I like the character and the pose.', '2004-03-15 01:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(621232, 64541, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting, especially of the hair.</td>', 'I really like the lighting, especially of the hair.', '2004-03-15 01:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(621233, 64618, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is such a nice natural pose.  I like it alot.  It does look a little over-neatimaged.</td>', 'This is such a nice natural pose.  I like it alot.  It does look a little over-neatimaged.', '2004-03-15 01:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(621234, 64527, 14986, '<td valign="top">Wow...those eyes just POP!  Just a beautiful job with the tones and the colors.</td>', 'Wow...those eyes just POP!  Just a beautiful job with the tones and the colors.', '2004-03-15 01:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(621235, 64366, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the pose, but the lighting is really orange and I don''t care for that.   And I hope I don''t offend, but a little powder on her nose would help.</td>', 'I like the pose, but the lighting is really orange and I don''t care for that.   And I hope I don''t offend, but a little powder on her nose would help.', '2004-03-15 01:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(621236, 64451, 14109, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on the piano. Subject looks familiar</td>', 'Great lighting on the piano. Subject looks familiar', '2004-03-15 01:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(621237, 64534, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very nicely done shot of a darling girl.  I like it in b/w, but would like to see it in color.  Really nice capture of the expression.</td>', 'I think this is a very nicely done shot of a darling girl.  I like it in b/w, but would like to see it in color.  Really nice capture of the expression.', '2004-03-15 01:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(621238, 64632, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice blurred background.  Huge smiles, but it''s a nice photo of the couple.</td>', 'Nice blurred background.  Huge smiles, but it''s a nice photo of the couple.', '2004-03-15 01:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(621239, 64645, 14986, '<td valign="top">In my opinion...too close, too dark, and too out of focus.  I think you really need somehow to see the eyes better.</td>', 'In my opinion...too close, too dark, and too out of focus.  I think you really need somehow to see the eyes better.', '2004-03-15 01:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(621240, 64622, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the highlights on the hair.  I would have liked more lighting to somehow bring out the eyes.  I don''t care for shots of ladies with their head resting on a closed fist.</td>', 'I like the highlights on the hair.  I would have liked more lighting to somehow bring out the eyes.  I don''t care for shots of ladies with their head resting on a closed fist.', '2004-03-15 01:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(621241, 64566, 9285, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot!!</td>', 'Very cute shot!!', '2004-03-15 01:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(621242, 64036, 9285, '<td valign="top">Nice effect... !! how did u do it?</td>', 'Nice effect... !! how did u do it?', '2004-03-15 01:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(621243, 64180, 14986, '<td valign="top">Is there a little girl underneath all those feathers, hat and flower???  LOL  cute shot, but I think maybe a bit overdone on the props.</td>', 'Is there a little girl underneath all those feathers, hat and flower???  LOL  cute shot, but I think maybe a bit overdone on the props.', '2004-03-15 01:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(621244, 64167, 14986, '<td valign="top">Kind of looks like a head floating in space.</td>', 'Kind of looks like a head floating in space.', '2004-03-15 01:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(621245, 64112, 14986, '<td valign="top">Heavy highlights on the hair take the eye away from her face.  There is a cool feel to the light on the right side of her face, but everything else seems very warm.</td>', 'Heavy highlights on the hair take the eye away from her face.  There is a cool feel to the light on the right side of her face, but everything else seems very warm.', '2004-03-15 01:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(621246, 64370, 14986, '<td valign="top">Cutest baby picture of the bunch.  Great lighting and background.  I like the splash of yellow from the toy.  Perfect little boy look and expression.  Clear as can be.  Only thinkg I would change is the border.  Actually, I would get rid of the border.</td>', 'Cutest baby picture of the bunch.  Great lighting and background.  I like the splash of yellow from the toy.  Perfect little boy look and expression.  Clear as can be.  Only thinkg I would change is the border.  Actually, I would get rid of the border.', '2004-03-15 01:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(621247, 64641, 14986, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is a flattering shot of your baby.  It''s so close that the baby looks flattened almost.  I would back up quite a bit, focus on the eyes and maybe use a little neat image ti even out the skin tones a bit.</td>', 'I don''t think this is a flattering shot of your baby.  It''s so close that the baby looks flattened almost.  I would back up quite a bit, focus on the eyes and maybe use a little neat image ti even out the skin tones a bit.', '2004-03-15 01:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(621248, 64562, 14986, '<td valign="top">Aww...I think this is a very nice pet portrait.</td>', 'Aww...I think this is a very nice pet portrait.', '2004-03-15 01:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(621250, 64451, 12252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. A wall hanger for sure. Bit of a white hot spot near the keys, and the background behind the model isn''t my taste, but might just be me. Really well done photograph...</td>', 'Beautiful shot. A wall hanger for sure. Bit of a white hot spot near the keys, and the background behind the model isn''t my taste, but might just be me. Really well done photograph...', '2004-03-15 01:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(621251, 64428, 12252, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the title &lt;hee hee&gt;. Pose is magnificent, and the sepia is a good choice. His hand is a bit washed out. Good stuff...a keeper!</td>', 'Great shot, love the title <hee hee>. Pose is magnificent, and the sepia is a good choice. His hand is a bit washed out. Good stuff...a keeper!', '2004-03-15 01:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(621253, 64570, 12252, '<td valign="top">One of the most creative of the challenge. Should be a strong finisher!</td>', 'One of the most creative of the challenge. Should be a strong finisher!', '2004-03-15 01:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
