(621387, 64633, 8643, '<td valign="top">What a great picture and a lovely portrait.  You really want to know what he''s thinking.  Very effective use of black and white - colour would detract.</td>', 'What a great picture and a lovely portrait.  You really want to know what he''s thinking.  Very effective use of black and white - colour would detract.', '2004-03-15 05:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(621391, 64530, 8643, '<td valign="top">Nice interesting portrait.  Like the idea of the rotated crop but a portrait instead of landscape aspect (just rotate the whole picture 90 degrees ccw!) would possibly make it easier to view - I keep twisting my neck.  Nicely lit.</td>', 'Nice interesting portrait.  Like the idea of the rotated crop but a portrait instead of landscape aspect (just rotate the whole picture 90 degrees ccw!) would possibly make it easier to view - I keep twisting my neck.  Nicely lit.', '2004-03-15 05:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
