(621395, 64640, 8643, '<td valign="top">What a lovely expression - the background is a bit busy but who cares?  Nice lighting and it brings out those beautiful skin tones.</td>', 'What a lovely expression - the background is a bit busy but who cares?  Nice lighting and it brings out those beautiful skin tones.', '2004-03-15 05:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
