(621400, 63931, 8643, '<td valign="top">No doubt the title tells a story - an effective study.  Maybe the highlights are a bit overexposed but it does not detract from the photo.  Maybe a sqaure on crop would have been OK too?</td>', 'No doubt the title tells a story - an effective study.  Maybe the highlights are a bit overexposed but it does not detract from the photo.  Maybe a sqaure on crop would have been OK too?', '2004-03-15 05:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
