(621411, 64474, 8643, '<td valign="top">Black on black - I like it.  Nice pose and great use of loads of negative space.  Lighting on the face and hair are good.</td>', 'Black on black - I like it.  Nice pose and great use of loads of negative space.  Lighting on the face and hair are good.', '2004-03-15 05:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
