(621416, 64353, 8643, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, lovely skin tones, attractive portrait.  The unusual aspect ratio is challenging and I can''t make up my mind about it and maybe the border interferes.  never mind, the overall effect is great.</td>', 'Nice lighting, lovely skin tones, attractive portrait.  The unusual aspect ratio is challenging and I can''t make up my mind about it and maybe the border interferes.  never mind, the overall effect is great.', '2004-03-15 05:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
