(621435, 64181, 8643, '<td valign="top">Quite a formal portrait, well lit especially considering the challenge of shadows from the peaked hat.  The sepia works well - perhaps the background would have been less intrusive if it was further away but it is a nice study anyway.</td>', 'Quite a formal portrait, well lit especially considering the challenge of shadows from the peaked hat.  The sepia works well - perhaps the background would have been less intrusive if it was further away but it is a nice study anyway.', '2004-03-15 06:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
