(621481, 64650, 8643, '<td valign="top">Ah, it isn''t a black and white study!  Well, the eyes made me look again and again, so you achieved an important effect.  Like the subtle lighting, although it is a pity that his right cheeck appears to be just blown out - maybe a bit of tissue over the light - but an effective portrait anyway.</td>', 'Ah, it isn''t a black and white study!  Well, the eyes made me look again and again, so you achieved an important effect.  Like the subtle lighting, although it is a pity that his right cheeck appears to be just blown out - maybe a bit of tissue over the light - but an effective portrait anyway.', '2004-03-15 07:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(621483, 64516, 245, '<td valign="top">i really like the slight darkening in the background, which is just enough to sow the edge of your sweater. The detail is great, too... but it feels slightly oversharpened to me. Look at the eye on the left, and the teeth... i see halos!</td>', 'i really like the slight darkening in the background, which is just enough to sow the edge of your sweater. The detail is great, too... but it feels slightly oversharpened to me. Look at the eye on the left, and the teeth... i see halos!', '2004-03-15 07:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
