(621534, 64422, 8643, '<td valign="top">Like the catchlights in the eyes and the otherwise gentle lighting - very attractive pose and a crop that adds to the pleasing effect.  Maybe the highlights in the headband are blown out but the effect doesn''t detract.</td>', 'Like the catchlights in the eyes and the otherwise gentle lighting - very attractive pose and a crop that adds to the pleasing effect.  Maybe the highlights in the headband are blown out but the effect doesn''t detract.', '2004-03-15 07:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
