(621598, 64598, 8643, '<td valign="top">I play too but not often enough!  Nice idea but perhaps the subject should be further away from the background to drop it out of focus and Imaybe I would crop to the waist and not crop the trumpet, giving a landscape portrait of a trumpet player - great!</td>', 'I play too but not often enough!  Nice idea but perhaps the subject should be further away from the background to drop it out of focus and Imaybe I would crop to the waist and not crop the trumpet, giving a landscape portrait of a trumpet player - great!', '2004-03-15 08:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
