(621816, 64280, 9504, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is kind of scary.  This man looks a LOT like my neighbor who died back in June.  Freaky.  Nice capture.  Very clear, great color -- I just would haven''t put him dead center in the frame.</td>', 'Wow.  This is kind of scary.  This man looks a LOT like my neighbor who died back in June.  Freaky.  Nice capture.  Very clear, great color -- I just would haven''t put him dead center in the frame.', '2004-03-15 10:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(621818, 64612, 327, '<td valign="top">It''s sad to see anyone so over weight. Poor gal, hope she does okay. I like your shot, like the tones and the composition. The focus is outstanding. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s sad to see anyone so over weight. Poor gal, hope she does okay. I like your shot, like the tones and the composition. The focus is outstanding. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-03-15 10:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
