(621820, 64462, 9073, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look happy about it. Maybe being a model is what upsets her. Silly, if you ask me - the capture is very nice. She should be proud.</td>', 'She doesn''t look happy about it. Maybe being a model is what upsets her. Silly, if you ask me - the capture is very nice. She should be proud.', '2004-03-15 10:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
