(621858, 64594, 9504, '<td valign="top">You have a beautiful cat.  Bravo to you for taking something other than a human!!  I wish the ear was in the frame and the shadows weren''t so harsh but otherwise nice capture.</td>', 'You have a beautiful cat.  Bravo to you for taking something other than a human!!  I wish the ear was in the frame and the shadows weren''t so harsh but otherwise nice capture.', '2004-03-15 10:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
