(621880, 64353, 9504, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo which is well executed but with the clarity being so sharp it is almost harsh.  I won''t take off for it, but my personal preference would have been to see this softer -- but that is a ''personal'' opinion.  Great job.</td>', 'This is a nice photo which is well executed but with the clarity being so sharp it is almost harsh.  I won''t take off for it, but my personal preference would have been to see this softer -- but that is a ''personal'' opinion.  Great job.', '2004-03-15 10:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(621881, 64438, 327, '<td valign="top">Handsome young man. The light is okay maybe a little more on his face. The focus is soft and we need to see him sharp and crisp. Good luck.</td>', 'Handsome young man. The light is okay maybe a little more on his face. The focus is soft and we need to see him sharp and crisp. Good luck.', '2004-03-15 10:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
