(621891, 64590, 9504, '<td valign="top">Those curtains in the background really take away from the photograph and the green chair doesn''t add much either.  Now, the woman is a great subject and you capture a nice photograph of her face!</td>', 'Those curtains in the background really take away from the photograph and the green chair doesn''t add much either.  Now, the woman is a great subject and you capture a nice photograph of her face!', '2004-03-15 10:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
