(622077, 64633, 15207, '<td valign="top">My number one favorite for this challenge. I love these guys. I''m glad someone took a risk and captured a portrait of a best instead of a human. I like how you captured his inprisonment in the expression and his hand on the bar. Good luck with this one. I''m sure you''ll do very well. Great lighting and composition as well.</td>', 'My number one favorite for this challenge. I love these guys. I''m glad someone took a risk and captured a portrait of a best instead of a human. I like how you captured his inprisonment in the expression and his hand on the bar. Good luck with this one. I''m sure you''ll do very well. Great lighting and composition as well.', '2004-03-15 12:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(622078, 64462, 6667, '<td valign="top">The expression, the light, and the skin tone are great.  A little overexposed to thte left.  IMO, the towel is a take away.  It contradicts the softness of the robe. BOL</td>', 'The expression, the light, and the skin tone are great.  A little overexposed to thte left.  IMO, the towel is a take away.  It contradicts the softness of the robe. BOL', '2004-03-15 12:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
