(622082, 64502, 15207, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot. I love the mood. Good luck!</td>', 'A lovely shot. I love the mood. Good luck!', '2004-03-15 12:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(622083, 64321, 6667, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. BOL That line on the left is distracting.  I assume it is the frame of the mirror.  Cropping it out would have done it I think.</td>', 'Nicely done. BOL That line on the left is distracting.  I assume it is the frame of the mirror.  Cropping it out would have done it I think.', '2004-03-15 12:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(622084, 64564, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great expression. Good luck!</td>', 'Great expression. Good luck!', '2004-03-15 12:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(622085, 64574, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really conveys a mood. Good luck!</td>', 'Really conveys a mood. Good luck!', '2004-03-15 12:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(622086, 64275, 15207, '<td valign="top">This really conveys a mood. Great lighting and skin tones. My only suggestion would be to extend the image out a bit to the left - even if it''s just negative/empty space. The way it is posed would suggest the composition needs some balance to the left of the woman''s face. However, overall great shot. I hope you do well!</td>', 'This really conveys a mood. Great lighting and skin tones. My only suggestion would be to extend the image out a bit to the left - even if it''s just negative/empty space. The way it is posed would suggest the composition needs some balance to the left of the woman''s face. However, overall great shot. I hope you do well!', '2004-03-15 12:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(622087, 64645, 15207, '<td valign="top">Wonderful expression! Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful expression! Good luck!', '2004-03-15 12:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(622091, 64422, 6667, '<td valign="top">Hi, Isa. . . are you married yet :-)  Cute shot.  BOL. Love the tilt and expression.</td>', 'Hi, Isa. . . are you married yet :-)  Cute shot.  BOL. Love the tilt and expression.', '2004-03-15 12:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(622093, 64626, 15207, '<td valign="top">I like the expression you captured from both subjects - like they''re both in synch. Great composition and good tones/lighting. Good luck!</td>', 'I like the expression you captured from both subjects - like they''re both in synch. Great composition and good tones/lighting. Good luck!', '2004-03-15 12:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(622095, 64511, 6667, '<td valign="top">And a musical note she is! Pretty blue eyes. BOL  Would have liked to see the full head.</td>', 'And a musical note she is! Pretty blue eyes. BOL  Would have liked to see the full head.', '2004-03-15 12:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(622096, 64550, 6667, '<td valign="top">Too tight and a little too dark.  Like the large eyes all around!</td>', 'Too tight and a little too dark.  Like the large eyes all around!', '2004-03-15 12:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(622099, 64180, 6667, '<td valign="top">She''s got my heart!  Nicely done. BOL IMHO a little more contrast! I think a darkened hat and hair might pop her face out even more.</td>', 'She''s got my heart!  Nicely done. BOL IMHO a little more contrast! I think a darkened hat and hair might pop her face out even more.', '2004-03-15 12:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(622101, 64592, 7711, '<td valign="top">your model is lovely, and the composition is good, but there is something about the colours that makes me pause..maybe its that the yellows of the daffodils are not vibrant. It almost seems slightly underexposed? I''m not sure what it is, but that''s the only reservation I have on this shot. :)</td>', 'your model is lovely, and the composition is good, but there is something about the colours that makes me pause..maybe its that the yellows of the daffodils are not vibrant. It almost seems slightly underexposed? I''m not sure what it is, but that''s the only reservation I have on this shot. :)', '2004-03-15 12:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(622103, 64632, 6667, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this shot.  The large, beautiful smiles make it.  An a cute couple they are.  Coupple of personal preferences: Yhe teeth on the young man needed to be brightened, hers somewhat.  Left side should be burned in some more.  While her hair isnatural and casual it is a little too disheveled.  Despite these observations you still got a good rating from me.</td>', 'I really, really like this shot.  The large, beautiful smiles make it.  An a cute couple they are.  Coupple of personal preferences: Yhe teeth on the young man needed to be brightened, hers somewhat.  Left side should be burned in some more.  While her hair isnatural and casual it is a little too disheveled.  Despite these observations you still got a good rating from me.', '2004-03-15 12:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(622104, 64573, 7711, '<td valign="top">the guy in the background makes it look quite candid. I think a closer crop would have helped make this look more purposeful.</td>', 'the guy in the background makes it look quite candid. I think a closer crop would have helped make this look more purposeful.', '2004-03-15 12:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(622105, 64409, 6667, '<td valign="top">Sharpnes and and a little more contrast needed.</td>', 'Sharpnes and and a little more contrast needed.', '2004-03-15 12:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(622106, 64653, 13602, '<td valign="top">verry well done, good light tones and pose and the model is lovely.</td>', 'verry well done, good light tones and pose and the model is lovely.', '2004-03-15 12:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(622107, 64263, 6667, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Green eyes added or for real?  Crop  on he right needs to be tighter. BOL</td>', 'Wow!  Green eyes added or for real?  Crop  on he right needs to be tighter. BOL', '2004-03-15 12:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(622108, 63815, 3087, '<td valign="top">The two areas of background at each side add nothing to the image and I think portrait orientation would have created a stronger composition. An interesting image that tells a little about the subject.</td>', 'The two areas of background at each side add nothing to the image and I think portrait orientation would have created a stronger composition. An interesting image that tells a little about the subject.', '2004-03-15 12:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(622111, 64650, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and composition. Personally not keen on the harsh lighting nor the selective desaturation.</td>', 'Nice pose and composition. Personally not keen on the harsh lighting nor the selective desaturation.', '2004-03-15 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(622112, 64651, 7711, '<td valign="top">because you chose a landscape orientation, I''d almost like a little more space on the right side to give the captain more to look into. Its a great shot, however. Wonderful tones! Only thing missing is that bit of hair at the top. ;)</td>', 'because you chose a landscape orientation, I''d almost like a little more space on the right side to give the captain more to look into. Its a great shot, however. Wonderful tones! Only thing missing is that bit of hair at the top. ;)', '2004-03-15 12:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(622113, 64534, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a sweet moment. Lighting just a touch harsh on her nose and cheek. Detail is great - in her hair, cardigan and skin.</td>', 'Nice capture of a sweet moment. Lighting just a touch harsh on her nose and cheek. Detail is great - in her hair, cardigan and skin.', '2004-03-15 12:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(622114, 64481, 6667, '<td valign="top">When this picture opened, my first though was a rose and the opera, Carmen.  What a beauty. BOL.  My only comment is a tighter crop on both sides.</td>', 'When this picture opened, my first though was a rose and the opera, Carmen.  What a beauty. BOL.  My only comment is a tighter crop on both sides.', '2004-03-15 12:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(622115, 64639, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the sulky expression - makes a change from the forced smiles in some entries. I think the composition doesn''t feel balanced - he''s not far enough off-centre for it to feel deliberate, so I''d crop to centre him horizontally. I would also avoid cropping off the bottom of his left foot. Exposure seems a little harsh with top bleeding into background - I wonder whether, for a black and white shot, a non-white Tshirt would have worked better?</td>', 'I like the sulky expression - makes a change from the forced smiles in some entries. I think the composition doesn''t feel balanced - he''s not far enough off-centre for it to feel deliberate, so I''d crop to centre him horizontally. I would also avoid cropping off the bottom of his left foot. Exposure seems a little harsh with top bleeding into background - I wonder whether, for a black and white shot, a non-white Tshirt would have worked better?', '2004-03-15 12:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(622116, 64031, 13602, '<td valign="top">not a portrait</td>', 'not a portrait', '2004-03-15 12:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(622117, 64361, 14715, '<td valign="top">Hard shot.  I would have provided a little more light to capture the backside of subjects face, as well as the dog''s.   Looks like a bit of slight action on the dog''s ears, which could be just my horrible monitor or softness of lighting.  If it is motion blur, providing that little bit more light coming from the right side might allow a faster shutter.  <br/>Good picture though.</td>', 'Hard shot.  I would have provided a little more light to capture the backside of subjects face, as well as the dog''s.   Looks like a bit of slight action on the dog''s ears, which could be just my horrible monitor or softness of lighting.  If it is motion blur, providing that little bit more light coming from the right side might allow a faster shutter.  Good picture though.', '2004-03-15 12:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(622118, 64502, 6667, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. However, does not fit my interpretation of a Portrait.  Guess I am a traditionalist.  BOL</td>', 'Nicely done. However, does not fit my interpretation of a Portrait.  Guess I am a traditionalist.  BOL', '2004-03-15 12:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(622120, 64610, 14715, '<td valign="top">Too soft outlne of face.  Looks almost blurred in on his right side.  Backgroud really destracts being so bright.  Good lighting on subject though.</td>', 'Too soft outlne of face.  Looks almost blurred in on his right side.  Backgroud really destracts being so bright.  Good lighting on subject though.', '2004-03-15 12:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(622121, 64560, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this portrait. The toning works well with the content though it''s a touch too pink for my preference. The textured background really supports his weary expression. Although a commonly expressed "rule" of portraiture is to achieve eye contact I think this image works superbly without it. I like the detail added by the pattern of his shirt.</td>', 'I like this portrait. The toning works well with the content though it''s a touch too pink for my preference. The textured background really supports his weary expression. Although a commonly expressed "rule" of portraiture is to achieve eye contact I think this image works superbly without it. I like the detail added by the pattern of his shirt.', '2004-03-15 12:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(622122, 64596, 14715, '<td valign="top">More lighting on backside to highlight your hair''s profile.  (c:  Otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'More lighting on backside to highlight your hair''s profile.  (c:  Otherwise nice shot.', '2004-03-15 12:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(622123, 63965, 6667, '<td valign="top">It is too bad that microphone is there.  I think this is an admirable addition to any actors protfolio. BOL  Love the faded action in the background.  What is the play?</td>', 'It is too bad that microphone is there.  I think this is an admirable addition to any actors protfolio. BOL  Love the faded action in the background.  What is the play?', '2004-03-15 12:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(622124, 64618, 14514, '<td valign="top">I think you over photoshoped the face</td>', 'I think you over photoshoped the face', '2004-03-15 12:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(622126, 64321, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice choice to use limited lighting... a portrait that really conveys the photographer''s tendency to stay in the shadows rather than in front of the camera.</td>', 'Nice choice to use limited lighting... a portrait that really conveys the photographer''s tendency to stay in the shadows rather than in front of the camera.', '2004-03-15 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(622128, 64560, 15263, '<td valign="top">By my count this should be a winner... Great shot!</td>', 'By my count this should be a winner... Great shot!', '2004-03-15 12:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(622130, 64315, 3087, '<td valign="top">That hat provides a great frame as well as a wonderful sweeping S curve. The expression is nicely captured and clear for anyone to read... a look that conveys a warning... Black and white works well.</td>', 'That hat provides a great frame as well as a wonderful sweeping S curve. The expression is nicely captured and clear for anyone to read... a look that conveys a warning... Black and white works well.', '2004-03-15 12:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(622131, 63931, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, light too harsh for my tastes.</td>', 'Nice composition, light too harsh for my tastes.', '2004-03-15 12:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(622133, 64031, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait.. a self portrait perhaps.  You have become the cup and you are one with its contents :) = 10</td>', 'This is a great portrait.. a self portrait perhaps.  You have become the cup and you are one with its contents :) = 10', '2004-03-15 12:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(622134, 64543, 3087, '<td valign="top">A pretty portrait which I would like a lot more without the selective desaturation. Overall it feels a little grey to me though - the whites/ highlights aren''t looking white enough. Lacks contrast I think.</td>', 'A pretty portrait which I would like a lot more without the selective desaturation. Overall it feels a little grey to me though - the whites/ highlights aren''t looking white enough. Lacks contrast I think.', '2004-03-15 12:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(622135, 64618, 6667, '<td valign="top">Super!  If this doesn''t make the top five there is definitely someting wrong.  Those blue eyes get you and follow you.  Please, if somebody gives you a one. .  confront them for an explination!!!  BOL</td>', 'Super!  If this doesn''t make the top five there is definitely someting wrong.  Those blue eyes get you and follow you.  Please, if somebody gives you a one. .  confront them for an explination!!!  BOL', '2004-03-15 12:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(622138, 64428, 3087, '<td valign="top">I usually like clean white or black backgrounds but something about the white background here doesn''t feel quite right. Though it''s clearly posed I like the way this shows contemplation by using a non-formal pose.</td>', 'I usually like clean white or black backgrounds but something about the white background here doesn''t feel quite right. Though it''s clearly posed I like the way this shows contemplation by using a non-formal pose.', '2004-03-15 12:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(622139, 64625, 6667, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  left side of the screen is somewhat out of focus.  IMHO, I would have croppped out more of the rights side. BOL</td>', 'Great shot.  left side of the screen is somewhat out of focus.  IMHO, I would have croppped out more of the rights side. BOL', '2004-03-15 12:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(622140, 64180, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a lovely smile - you''ve captured a beautiful expression there - she looks wise and happy beyond her years. A lovely use of the boa to soften the surroundings and provide contrast to the harder colour/ lines of the hat. Lighting seems a touch harsh on her cheek but otherwise this is lovely.</td>', 'What a lovely smile - you''ve captured a beautiful expression there - she looks wise and happy beyond her years. A lovely use of the boa to soften the surroundings and provide contrast to the harder colour/ lines of the hat. Lighting seems a touch harsh on her cheek but otherwise this is lovely.', '2004-03-15 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(622141, 64208, 6667, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The background is a little too busy and distracting though.</td>', 'Great shot.  The background is a little too busy and distracting though.', '2004-03-15 12:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(622142, 64393, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition here. The hand in the front with the angled face further back - it''s unusual and quirky and works very well. I also like the low-key nature of this image, black on black on black. It''s a beautiful portrait of the individual and a great image.</td>', 'I really like your composition here. The hand in the front with the angled face further back - it''s unusual and quirky and works very well. I also like the low-key nature of this image, black on black on black. It''s a beautiful portrait of the individual and a great image.', '2004-03-15 12:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(622143, 64529, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty ladies. I''m not sure why the tones/treatment? It just makes them look washed out. Focus is good.</td>', 'Pretty ladies. I''m not sure why the tones/treatment? It just makes them look washed out. Focus is good.', '2004-03-15 12:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(622147, 64321, 14514, '<td valign="top">I feel a tighter crop on the bottom would improve this shot, good pic though</td>', 'I feel a tighter crop on the bottom would improve this shot, good pic though', '2004-03-15 12:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(622148, 64465, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this, but would not think of it as a portrait. Wish we could see her face.</td>', 'I like this, but would not think of it as a portrait. Wish we could see her face.', '2004-03-15 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(622150, 64523, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice to see such an unusual viewpoint and I love your use of the boa to provide texture in the rest of the frame. My only suggestion would be to choose a colour other than pink which does nothing complimentary for her skin tones. And is that sunburn on her forehead or a lighting issue or oversaturation of the colours or something else? One of the best entries for me in this challenge though.</td>', 'Nice to see such an unusual viewpoint and I love your use of the boa to provide texture in the rest of the frame. My only suggestion would be to choose a colour other than pink which does nothing complimentary for her skin tones. And is that sunburn on her forehead or a lighting issue or oversaturation of the colours or something else? One of the best entries for me in this challenge though.', '2004-03-15 12:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(622151, 64647, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute sleeping baby. Seeing more blanket then baby, little grain, but the light is okay.<br/></td>', 'Cute sleeping baby. Seeing more blanket then baby, little grain, but the light is okay.', '2004-03-15 12:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(622152, 63868, 3087, '<td valign="top">A nice use of her hair to provide shape and framing. Such a close up demands more perfection though and I''d really like to remove those stray hairs on her face. It also feels as though she is squinting against bright light, and I''d like to see her eye opened to a more natural extent. Great choice to go black and white with a touch of toming (though it appears a touch too green for my tastes).</td>', 'A nice use of her hair to provide shape and framing. Such a close up demands more perfection though and I''d really like to remove those stray hairs on her face. It also feels as though she is squinting against bright light, and I''d like to see her eye opened to a more natural extent. Great choice to go black and white with a touch of toming (though it appears a touch too green for my tastes).', '2004-03-15 12:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(622153, 64644, 327, '<td valign="top">The colors are unusual. I don''t dislike them. She''s too cute be behind the hair. lol Nice shot but I don''t think this will fair well on DPC. I hope so ...! Good luck.</td>', 'The colors are unusual. I don''t dislike them. She''s too cute be behind the hair. lol Nice shot but I don''t think this will fair well on DPC. I hope so ...! Good luck.', '2004-03-15 12:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(622154, 64509, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Contrast is right on.  The only comment, and I know its picayune, but hte lettering on the shirt is distracting. BOL</td>', 'Very nice.  Contrast is right on.  The only comment, and I know its picayune, but hte lettering on the shirt is distracting. BOL', '2004-03-15 12:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(622157, 63885, 327, '<td valign="top">Little more light! I want to see her beautiful hair. Little cutie.</td>', 'Little more light! I want to see her beautiful hair. Little cutie.', '2004-03-15 12:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(622158, 64172, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is charming and feels very candid. I love the colours in the lips and jumper (sweater). The low DOF works for me too and the clean black background is just right. This is lovely.</td>', 'This is charming and feels very candid. I love the colours in the lips and jumper (sweater). The low DOF works for me too and the clean black background is just right. This is lovely.', '2004-03-15 12:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
