(622161, 64418, 14514, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot, but i feel it would look a lot better without the patch of light, it would be great if u could have made it all black in the background.</td>', 'This is a good shot, but i feel it would look a lot better without the patch of light, it would be great if u could have made it all black in the background.', '2004-03-15 12:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
