(622360, 64465, 15207, '<td valign="top">A great idea for this challenge. I like how the heads of the people add to the fact that this is a live performance. My only suggestion would be to have something in focus - even if it''s just the stage. It looks a little blurry to me. However, I love the colours. Good luck!</td>', 'A great idea for this challenge. I like how the heads of the people add to the fact that this is a live performance. My only suggestion would be to have something in focus - even if it''s just the stage. It looks a little blurry to me. However, I love the colours. Good luck!', '2004-03-15 14:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(622361, 64625, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I love the expression and the face. My only suggestion would be to set your camera on a tripod to ensure a sharper focus. However, I love the colours and the composition. Good luck!</td>', 'Great capture. I love the expression and the face. My only suggestion would be to set your camera on a tripod to ensure a sharper focus. However, I love the colours and the composition. Good luck!', '2004-03-15 14:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(622362, 64119, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. I like the colours and the lighting. IT really captures a mood - and makes me feel like I''m right there. My only suggestion would be to capture a bit more of the emtpy/negative space to the right (and, even then, only slightly) - the position of the boy is perfect, it just needs a bit more negative space, so to speak. I love it though and I hope you do well.</td>', 'I really like this one. I like the colours and the lighting. IT really captures a mood - and makes me feel like I''m right there. My only suggestion would be to capture a bit more of the emtpy/negative space to the right (and, even then, only slightly) - the position of the boy is perfect, it just needs a bit more negative space, so to speak. I love it though and I hope you do well.', '2004-03-15 14:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(622363, 64459, 15207, '<td valign="top">I love the expression here.I don''t normally like to see little ones wearing makeup but it was a good idea for this shot (and maybe you didn''t even put makeup on her - if not, she has great colour in her lips). I like the use of negative space as well. Good luck!</td>', 'I love the expression here.I don''t normally like to see little ones wearing makeup but it was a good idea for this shot (and maybe you didn''t even put makeup on her - if not, she has great colour in her lips). I like the use of negative space as well. Good luck!', '2004-03-15 14:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(622364, 64402, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great expression.I love this one.</td>', 'Great expression.I love this one.', '2004-03-15 14:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(622365, 64353, 15207, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here. I also like the expression. The only thing I notice is a lot of the foundation makeup shows up around the eyebrows in this one. I''m not sure if you could polish that up in PhotoShop or not... but overall I like the image a lot. Good luck!</td>', 'I like the composition here. I also like the expression. The only thing I notice is a lot of the foundation makeup shows up around the eyebrows in this one. I''m not sure if you could polish that up in PhotoShop or not... but overall I like the image a lot. Good luck!', '2004-03-15 14:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
