(622390, 64443, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great lighting here, and I like the expressions on the boy''s face and his head melting in the darkness. But his clothes are quite bad IMHO for this portrait. The white stripes on his T-shirtÍs neck always leads my eyes away from his face, as this is the whitest area on your photo. I would have chosen a dark T-shirt, to make his face the brightest area on the photo, it would make this photo excellent, this way it looks a bit strange to me.</td>', 'Great lighting here, and I like the expressions on the boy''s face and his head melting in the darkness. But his clothes are quite bad IMHO for this portrait. The white stripes on his T-shirtÍs neck always leads my eyes away from his face, as this is the whitest area on your photo. I would have chosen a dark T-shirt, to make his face the brightest area on the photo, it would make this photo excellent, this way it looks a bit strange to me.', '2004-03-15 14:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(622391, 63838, 327, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but I like this shot. Her eyes! Awesome. I wish the light was on her face or less blown out on the right. She is lovely and interesting to look at. Good shot really.</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but I like this shot. Her eyes! Awesome. I wish the light was on her face or less blown out on the right. She is lovely and interesting to look at. Good shot really.', '2004-03-15 14:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
