(622489, 64268, 4562, '<td valign="top">good job.  i did a pic like this on my 5 year old daughter(35mm) and it turned out great.  the blinds just add more emotion and depth to the whole picture good job!!</td>', 'good job.  i did a pic like this on my 5 year old daughter(35mm) and it turned out great.  the blinds just add more emotion and depth to the whole picture good job!!', '2004-03-15 16:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(622491, 64589, 3032, '<td valign="top">Vermeer.......... Very, very, very good reproduction!<br/>The moment it popped up on the voting screen I was in serious doubt if this was a real photo or a pained reproduction. The attention to detail (clothing, pose, colors, lighting, background, shadows, lip position) is so freaking good. Sure it has some flaws when it comes to comparing it to the actual painting, but that would be nitpicking.<br/>Absolutely love it, best photo on dpc since Redmappers "Dream of the Past" (unfortunately disqualified for a date infringement).</td>', 'Vermeer.......... Very, very, very good reproduction!The moment it popped up on the voting screen I was in serious doubt if this was a real photo or a pained reproduction. The attention to detail (clothing, pose, colors, lighting, background, shadows, lip position) is so freaking good. Sure it has some flaws when it comes to comparing it to the actual painting, but that would be nitpicking.Absolutely love it, best photo on dpc since Redmappers "Dream of the Past" (unfortunately disqualified for a date infringement).', '2004-03-15 16:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
