(622577, 64511, 772, '<td valign="top">"It is easy to make a picture of someone and call it a portrait. The difficulty lies in making a picture that makes the viewer care about a stranger." - Paul Strand" <br/> <br/>It''s a cute baby, but what differentiates this portrait from any other family album shot I would expect to see?</td>', '"It is easy to make a picture of someone and call it a portrait. The difficulty lies in making a picture that makes the viewer care about a stranger." - Paul Strand"  It''s a cute baby, but what differentiates this portrait from any other family album shot I would expect to see?', '2004-03-15 18:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
