(622585, 64529, 772, '<td valign="top">"It is easy to make a picture of someone and call it a portrait. The difficulty lies in making a picture that makes the viewer care about a stranger." - Paul Strand" <br/> <br/>This is not a bad composition.  I personally don''t care much for this exposure/post processing combo.</td>', '"It is easy to make a picture of someone and call it a portrait. The difficulty lies in making a picture that makes the viewer care about a stranger." - Paul Strand"  This is not a bad composition.  I personally don''t care much for this exposure/post processing combo.', '2004-03-15 18:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(622588, 64528, 6340, '<td valign="top">This portrait actually tells a story.  I like it.</td>', 'This portrait actually tells a story.  I like it.', '2004-03-15 18:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(622589, 64618, 6340, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and lighting.</td>', 'Nice focus and lighting.', '2004-03-15 18:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
