(622637, 64565, 327, '<td valign="top">Two dolls!! Great eye color with the blue shirt. I think if their head were closer and you cropped this a bit tighter this would of scored higher. The focus, light and color are great. Just the composition falls short. Wonderful lighting.</td>', 'Two dolls!! Great eye color with the blue shirt. I think if their head were closer and you cropped this a bit tighter this would of scored higher. The focus, light and color are great. Just the composition falls short. Wonderful lighting.', '2004-03-15 19:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(622638, 64158, 15207, '<td valign="top">A great shot. I love the pose and the expression. It looks like you really captured the subject having a good time. Also, I like that the smile doesn''t look forced. I love the tones and the overall composition. Good luck!</td>', 'A great shot. I love the pose and the expression. It looks like you really captured the subject having a good time. Also, I like that the smile doesn''t look forced. I love the tones and the overall composition. Good luck!', '2004-03-15 19:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
