(622640, 64519, 327, '<td valign="top">I''m back looking at this for the third time. I do like it. I think the fact that I don''t see his eyes is what''s kept me from commenting today. The focus, light, I like. Good shooting....I guess I''m just a ''need the eyes'' kind of gal. :)</td>', 'I''m back looking at this for the third time. I do like it. I think the fact that I don''t see his eyes is what''s kept me from commenting today. The focus, light, I like. Good shooting....I guess I''m just a ''need the eyes'' kind of gal. :)', '2004-03-15 19:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
