(622648, 64511, 15207, '<td valign="top">What beautiful blue eyes. This image really captures the essence of childhood. It''s a great shot. My only suggestion would be to do some processing work in PhotoShop around the colours. For some reason, the baby''s face picked up a bit of the blue of the outfit. Maybe playing with the channels and the contrast would help it a bit. Gotta love that soft baby skin.</td>', 'What beautiful blue eyes. This image really captures the essence of childhood. It''s a great shot. My only suggestion would be to do some processing work in PhotoShop around the colours. For some reason, the baby''s face picked up a bit of the blue of the outfit. Maybe playing with the channels and the contrast would help it a bit. Gotta love that soft baby skin.', '2004-03-15 19:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
