(622678, 64509, 15207, '<td valign="top">A great pose adn a great expression. The contrast is excellent in this one and is well served. My only suggestion would be to show a tiny bit more of the negative space in the background. I know negative space doesn''t always add to an image, but the subject is posed so that you almost expect just a few more pixels of background to balance out the composition. Overall I really like th eimage though. i hope you do well.</td>', 'A great pose adn a great expression. The contrast is excellent in this one and is well served. My only suggestion would be to show a tiny bit more of the negative space in the background. I know negative space doesn''t always add to an image, but the subject is posed so that you almost expect just a few more pixels of background to balance out the composition. Overall I really like th eimage though. i hope you do well.', '2004-03-15 19:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
