(622697, 64411, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this funky white/fade look here. I will say it''s not very natural looking..?beard? Still for a close shot as this one, it''s okay. I think the crop is alittle close to his nose and I wish we could see his eye more. Not a bad shot. Hope ya do well.</td>', 'I like this funky white/fade look here. I will say it''s not very natural looking..?beard? Still for a close shot as this one, it''s okay. I think the crop is alittle close to his nose and I wish we could see his eye more. Not a bad shot. Hope ya do well.', '2004-03-15 19:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(622700, 64632, 15207, '<td valign="top">The skin tones and lighting on this one are pitch perfect. I think it''s a great composition. My only suggestion would be to show a tiny (and I mean tiny) bit of the shoulders/arms - just because it would add to the fact that these two are also showing a bit of affection. I love the smiles and expressions. Overall, this is an excellent image and I''m sure you''re going to do really well in this challenge.</td>', 'The skin tones and lighting on this one are pitch perfect. I think it''s a great composition. My only suggestion would be to show a tiny (and I mean tiny) bit of the shoulders/arms - just because it would add to the fact that these two are also showing a bit of affection. I love the smiles and expressions. Overall, this is an excellent image and I''m sure you''re going to do really well in this challenge.', '2004-03-15 19:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(622702, 63965, 15207, '<td valign="top">This one really stands out. You chose an interesting subject who is actually doing something and I really commend you for doing something "outside the box" - I really like the tones, the contrast, the lighting, the expression and overall composition. I have the feeling you''ll be in the top three or four with this one. good luck!</td>', 'This one really stands out. You chose an interesting subject who is actually doing something and I really commend you for doing something "outside the box" - I really like the tones, the contrast, the lighting, the expression and overall composition. I have the feeling you''ll be in the top three or four with this one. good luck!', '2004-03-15 19:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
