(622833, 64516, 15207, '<td valign="top">A great subject iwth a nice natural expression. I like the white turtle neck combined with a white background. I think you''re going to do well on this one. Good luck!</td>', 'A great subject iwth a nice natural expression. I like the white turtle neck combined with a white background. I think you''re going to do well on this one. Good luck!', '2004-03-15 20:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
