(622839, 64485, 15207, '<td valign="top">I like the green eyes contrasting with teh dark shadows/contrast and the black and white. Kind of a Tom Green expression adds a bit of interest to the shot as well. Good luck!</td>', 'I like the green eyes contrasting with teh dark shadows/contrast and the black and white. Kind of a Tom Green expression adds a bit of interest to the shot as well. Good luck!', '2004-03-15 20:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(622840, 64622, 6667, '<td valign="top">I''m in love.  Fantastic shot. BOL</td>', 'I''m in love.  Fantastic shot. BOL', '2004-03-15 20:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(622841, 64590, 6888, '<td valign="top">not a classic portrait...has more of a snapshot fel to it...there is a reflection in her eyeglass lens that is distracting</td>', 'not a classic portrait...has more of a snapshot fel to it...there is a reflection in her eyeglass lens that is distracting', '2004-03-15 20:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(622842, 64550, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice humorous shot...i like the b/w and the composition of this shot</td>', 'nice humorous shot...i like the b/w and the composition of this shot', '2004-03-15 20:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(622843, 64438, 15207, '<td valign="top">I realize thisshot is posed, but you were able to really capture something candid here. A great subject. I think you''re going to do really well with this one. Good luck!</td>', 'I realize thisshot is posed, but you were able to really capture something candid here. A great subject. I think you''re going to do really well with this one. Good luck!', '2004-03-15 20:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(622845, 64556, 16608, '<td valign="top">Blue eyes ... blue tongue ... blue necklace ... blue drink ... Picasso had nothing on you kiddo.  Great amusing shot. Refreshing to see someone who doesn''t take themselves too seriously.  Wish I could vote  I''d give you a 10.</td>', 'Blue eyes ... blue tongue ... blue necklace ... blue drink ... Picasso had nothing on you kiddo.  Great amusing shot. Refreshing to see someone who doesn''t take themselves too seriously.  Wish I could vote  I''d give you a 10.', '2004-03-15 20:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(622846, 64462, 15207, '<td valign="top">A great title for this shot. Ireally like the lighting and the playfulness of hteimage. A nice ernest expression as well. GOod luck.</td>', 'A great title for this shot. Ireally like the lighting and the playfulness of hteimage. A nice ernest expression as well. GOod luck.', '2004-03-15 20:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(622847, 64541, 6888, '<td valign="top">very nicely done...focus is a bit soft but it works well on this...the pose looks natural</td>', 'very nicely done...focus is a bit soft but it works well on this...the pose looks natural', '2004-03-15 20:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(622849, 64516, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice job...well defined contrast between the sweater and the background...nice clear focus...well done</td>', 'nice job...well defined contrast between the sweater and the background...nice clear focus...well done', '2004-03-15 20:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(622850, 64158, 6388, '<td valign="top">I guess Taylor won''t have to complain that you use Hailey too much for contests anymore. ;)  I remember this punkin from the Off-center (i think) challenge.  She''s as adorable as ever, and you''ve done a great job catching her personality on camera (what''s that, innocence? sincereity? i don''t know...something).  Anyway, love it Paige.  great job.</td>', 'I guess Taylor won''t have to complain that you use Hailey too much for contests anymore. ;)  I remember this punkin from the Off-center (i think) challenge.  She''s as adorable as ever, and you''ve done a great job catching her personality on camera (what''s that, innocence? sincereity? i don''t know...something).  Anyway, love it Paige.  great job.', '2004-03-15 20:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(622851, 64438, 6888, '<td valign="top">not sure what to make of this ...the focus is soft but it looks good on this shot...i do like the b/w...i think the shadows on the wall from the plant are distracting</td>', 'not sure what to make of this ...the focus is soft but it looks good on this shot...i do like the b/w...i think the shadows on the wall from the plant are distracting', '2004-03-15 20:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(622852, 64563, 6667, '<td valign="top">I hope this young man is the son of a dentist.  If he isn''t . . . he should be.  Fantastic simile.  I wish the play ground equipment wasn''t there to distract from the face.   I can almost here his laughter.  BOL</td>', 'I hope this young man is the son of a dentist.  If he isn''t . . . he should be.  Fantastic simile.  I wish the play ground equipment wasn''t there to distract from the face.   I can almost here his laughter.  BOL', '2004-03-15 20:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(622853, 64528, 6888, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot...however for this challenge I would have liked a nice clean portrait...this is very moody and I like that</td>', 'very interesting shot...however for this challenge I would have liked a nice clean portrait...this is very moody and I like that', '2004-03-15 20:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(622854, 64516, 6667, '<td valign="top">Give yourself high marks!  BOL</td>', 'Give yourself high marks!  BOL', '2004-03-15 20:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(622856, 64577, 6667, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2004-03-15 20:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
