(622870, 64376, 6388, '<td valign="top">this seems to have telltale signs of neatimage (or some smoothing program or other).  maybe I''m wrong, but it looks artificially soft.  nice otherwise...interesting idea including the doll - nice shot.  Her mate will love this picture of her when she''s 25 :)<br/>Pedro</td>', 'this seems to have telltale signs of neatimage (or some smoothing program or other).  maybe I''m wrong, but it looks artificially soft.  nice otherwise...interesting idea including the doll - nice shot.  Her mate will love this picture of her when she''s 25 :)Pedro', '2004-03-15 20:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
