(622874, 64376, 2333, '<td valign="top">Teh soft light works well here. I wish the rail were a bit lower. the over all look is one of "soft focus" however detail is completely missing in the skin, as if NeatImage were over-applied.</td>', 'Teh soft light works well here. I wish the rail were a bit lower. the over all look is one of "soft focus" however detail is completely missing in the skin, as if NeatImage were over-applied.', '2004-03-15 21:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(622875, 64646, 12252, '<td valign="top">Moody. Kind of blown out on the forehead. The hair on the right hand side of the picture is distracting at first. But the eyes are very expressive!</td>', 'Moody. Kind of blown out on the forehead. The hair on the right hand side of the picture is distracting at first. But the eyes are very expressive!', '2004-03-15 21:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(622876, 64485, 12252, '<td valign="top">Rather scary image! It''s not just the green eyes (which were done well) but the whole mood of the piece. Yikes! Well done, but not something I''d want to look at very often, sorry!</td>', 'Rather scary image! It''s not just the green eyes (which were done well) but the whole mood of the piece. Yikes! Well done, but not something I''d want to look at very often, sorry!', '2004-03-15 21:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(622877, 64354, 12252, '<td valign="top">Yep, adorable is right. White shirt is a bit overexposed, and the cushion is just a little distracting. Good capture, though.</td>', 'Yep, adorable is right. White shirt is a bit overexposed, and the cushion is just a little distracting. Good capture, though.', '2004-03-15 21:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(622879, 64366, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, good color balance. I would have cropped more off the bottom of the picture. The only nit I have is that the female subject is looking just over my right shoulder, while the male model is looking right at me, and believe me this is nitpicking. Cute couple</td>', 'Nicely composed, good color balance. I would have cropped more off the bottom of the picture. The only nit I have is that the female subject is looking just over my right shoulder, while the male model is looking right at me, and believe me this is nitpicking. Cute couple', '2004-03-15 21:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(622881, 64513, 12252, '<td valign="top">I entered my comment and hit the wrong button. Damn! Anyway, good image; good capture of a mood, good use of black and white, but...his face is a bit flat and there''s a small black shadow (?) over his left shoulder that''s distracting. Overall, though, a good effort. Nice job!</td>', 'I entered my comment and hit the wrong button. Damn! Anyway, good image; good capture of a mood, good use of black and white, but...his face is a bit flat and there''s a small black shadow (?) over his left shoulder that''s distracting. Overall, though, a good effort. Nice job!', '2004-03-15 21:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(622882, 64541, 806, '<td valign="top">lovely use of dof. great clarity in the woman''s eyes. bunny''s eyes to woman''s eyes works well, but interest could have been made with bunny''s eyes to woman''s cheek too. Either way, you have shown an emotional closeness.</td>', 'lovely use of dof. great clarity in the woman''s eyes. bunny''s eyes to woman''s eyes works well, but interest could have been made with bunny''s eyes to woman''s cheek too. Either way, you have shown an emotional closeness.', '2004-03-15 21:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(622883, 64639, 12252, '<td valign="top">Very, very nicely done except for the shadow behind his right shoulder. A bit of diffused light on his right hand side of his face would also have helped. But what a shot otherwise! Great job!</td>', 'Very, very nicely done except for the shadow behind his right shoulder. A bit of diffused light on his right hand side of his face would also have helped. But what a shot otherwise! Great job!', '2004-03-15 21:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(622884, 64514, 806, '<td valign="top">my feeling is most of the black space on the left is unnecessary. My eye is also drawn more to the candle which makes your prop more the subject of interest than the person''s face.</td>', 'my feeling is most of the black space on the left is unnecessary. My eye is also drawn more to the candle which makes your prop more the subject of interest than the person''s face.', '2004-03-15 21:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(622885, 64622, 12252, '<td valign="top">Wow, such eyes! Great capture, good lighting, good cropping, good pose. This is an A+ portrait of a lovely subject.</td>', 'Wow, such eyes! Great capture, good lighting, good cropping, good pose. This is an A+ portrait of a lovely subject.', '2004-03-15 21:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(622886, 64181, 16479, '<td valign="top">very well done.. the background is really elegant, well-blend with the model....and the model is in his best posture... gave you 10 for this...</td>', 'very well done.. the background is really elegant, well-blend with the model....and the model is in his best posture... gave you 10 for this...', '2004-03-15 21:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(622888, 64441, 16216, '<td valign="top">Very Nice Capture, I would like so see some reflective light to bring out the facial highlights</td>', 'Very Nice Capture, I would like so see some reflective light to bring out the facial highlights', '2004-03-15 21:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(622889, 64574, 12252, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s not grabbing me. Hmmm... The background is kind of distracting with the fold so near her face. Her eyes are kind of half closed and she''s looking in an unusual direction. There''s a bit of a distraction in the black garmet by her neck with a bit of skin showing through. All that said, I think with a bit of effort you''d have something really cool here. Have her look up, perhaps.</td>', 'Well, it''s not grabbing me. Hmmm... The background is kind of distracting with the fold so near her face. Her eyes are kind of half closed and she''s looking in an unusual direction. There''s a bit of a distraction in the black garmet by her neck with a bit of skin showing through. All that said, I think with a bit of effort you''d have something really cool here. Have her look up, perhaps.', '2004-03-15 21:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(622890, 64527, 2333, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite shot of the challenge. Absolutely beautiful, love the lighting, expression, everything. Her eyes are amazing. Great work. Just for fun I tried applying a touch of soft focus (3.px gaussian blur faded to 33% with the eyes &amp; lips masked to remain sharp) and I really liked the result...<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'This is my favorite shot of the challenge. Absolutely beautiful, love the lighting, expression, everything. Her eyes are amazing. Great work. Just for fun I tried applying a touch of soft focus (3.px gaussian blur faded to 33% with the eyes & lips masked to remain sharp) and I really liked the result...Good luck!', '2004-03-15 21:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(622891, 64280, 12252, '<td valign="top">Wow...great character study. Perfect, spot on focus, fabulous DOF. Might have cropped slightly closer on each side, but this is a terrific portrait no matter what. Deserves a nice expensive frame and a place on someone''s wall.</td>', 'Wow...great character study. Perfect, spot on focus, fabulous DOF. Might have cropped slightly closer on each side, but this is a terrific portrait no matter what. Deserves a nice expensive frame and a place on someone''s wall.', '2004-03-15 21:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(622892, 64592, 12252, '<td valign="top">Shucks, that looks like a wedding ring. &lt;sigh&gt; Anyhoo, pretty darn good portrait. Skin tones are flawless, focus is perfect, DOF good. My only nit is the crop at the bottom. That one daffodill between her wrists is distracting.</td>', 'Shucks, that looks like a wedding ring. <sigh> Anyhoo, pretty darn good portrait. Skin tones are flawless, focus is perfect, DOF good. My only nit is the crop at the bottom. That one daffodill between her wrists is distracting.', '2004-03-15 21:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(622894, 64633, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull expression and great toning used.   Good luck.  Jacko. 10</td>', 'Wonderfull expression and great toning used.   Good luck.  Jacko. 10', '2004-03-15 21:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(622895, 64490, 2333, '<td valign="top">One of my top two for this challenge. Love the pose, love the background &amp; soft light. I like how the green in the sweater is echoed in just the spot of foliage in the background. I found myself wishing for just a touch more contrast, &amp; possibly a bit of desaturation of the red in her cheeks (but not much!). Very nice work, good luck.</td>', 'One of my top two for this challenge. Love the pose, love the background & soft light. I like how the green in the sweater is echoed in just the spot of foliage in the background. I found myself wishing for just a touch more contrast, & possibly a bit of desaturation of the red in her cheeks (but not much!). Very nice work, good luck.', '2004-03-15 21:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(622897, 64517, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nice job. It doesn''t pop out from the competition, but there''s not much to complain about either. There is something behind his shoulders (greyish) that''s distracting.</td>', 'Nice job. It doesn''t pop out from the competition, but there''s not much to complain about either. There is something behind his shoulders (greyish) that''s distracting.', '2004-03-15 21:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(622898, 64594, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like animal portraits, but this one is a bit too weird. Those eyes?!?!</td>', 'I like animal portraits, but this one is a bit too weird. Those eyes?!?!', '2004-03-15 21:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(622899, 64574, 806, '<td valign="top">dark shadow under her chin and on her neck may have been avoided with a reflector (homemade or store bought). there are also other shadows that may have been softened in this way, or with a fill light.<br/>a soft expression is also sometimes more effective with a tighter crop. :)</td>', 'dark shadow under her chin and on her neck may have been avoided with a reflector (homemade or store bought). there are also other shadows that may have been softened in this way, or with a fill light.a soft expression is also sometimes more effective with a tighter crop. :)', '2004-03-15 21:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(622900, 64474, 12252, '<td valign="top">I wish her hair was lit better. The drink is sort of unfocused, oddly, because everything else is well focused. For my tastes, too much black so I would have cropped closer. Mostly, though, give that hair some light!</td>', 'I wish her hair was lit better. The drink is sort of unfocused, oddly, because everything else is well focused. For my tastes, too much black so I would have cropped closer. Mostly, though, give that hair some light!', '2004-03-15 21:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(622903, 64239, 12252, '<td valign="top">Seems more like a candid snap than a portrait. I guess technically it''s a portrait, but the subject''s head is actually a very small portion of the total image and not well lit at that. Hard to get much from what''s here...</td>', 'Seems more like a candid snap than a portrait. I guess technically it''s a portrait, but the subject''s head is actually a very small portion of the total image and not well lit at that. Hard to get much from what''s here...', '2004-03-15 21:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(622904, 64633, 2333, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. A very sensitive portrait. I predict a top-ten finish. I think the only things i would change are to crop the black bar from right side and carefully clone out the fibrous-looking thigy (plant stem?) at lower right. Very nice work, good luck!</td>', 'I love this shot. A very sensitive portrait. I predict a top-ten finish. I think the only things i would change are to crop the black bar from right side and carefully clone out the fibrous-looking thigy (plant stem?) at lower right. Very nice work, good luck!', '2004-03-15 21:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(622905, 64204, 806, '<td valign="top">this goes against everything I''ve been taught - showing the soles of the shoes, having props in the way..<br/>yet, it works on a certain level. I might like to see one of his hands to connect the legs/feet with the torso/head. The position of the body makes this look a bit disjointed.</td>', 'this goes against everything I''ve been taught - showing the soles of the shoes, having props in the way..yet, it works on a certain level. I might like to see one of his hands to connect the legs/feet with the torso/head. The position of the body makes this look a bit disjointed.', '2004-03-15 21:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(622906, 64353, 12252, '<td valign="top">Lovely, and I have two suggestions: a bit more DOF so her shoulder is in focus, and move that one strand of hair from her right cheek. Otherwise flawless job. Oh...I don''t like the white frame the way you did it, but remember, that''s just an issuse of taste. I like the white surrounded by solid black. Lovely model and you did her proud!</td>', 'Lovely, and I have two suggestions: a bit more DOF so her shoulder is in focus, and move that one strand of hair from her right cheek. Otherwise flawless job. Oh...I don''t like the white frame the way you did it, but remember, that''s just an issuse of taste. I like the white surrounded by solid black. Lovely model and you did her proud!', '2004-03-15 21:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(622908, 64326, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. What I like is the expression you''ve captured, the way you cropped the photo, the contrasts and levels in black ad white. The whitish background is a bit noisy but this is a fine photograph.</td>', 'I like this a lot. What I like is the expression you''ve captured, the way you cropped the photo, the contrasts and levels in black ad white. The whitish background is a bit noisy but this is a fine photograph.', '2004-03-15 21:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(622909, 64534, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting shot. lovely expression. really like how you have incorporated the reflection. I''d like to see her head turned slightly toward camera so that her nose doesn''t cut the cheek line. nice even lighting. nice use of black and white. overall a treasure!</td>', 'interesting shot. lovely expression. really like how you have incorporated the reflection. I''d like to see her head turned slightly toward camera so that her nose doesn''t cut the cheek line. nice even lighting. nice use of black and white. overall a treasure!', '2004-03-15 21:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(622911, 64610, 12252, '<td valign="top">I wish you hadn''t feathered so much, I found it distracting. Could be a great image. Wonder how it would look with a black background (except you might "lose" his hair that way). i do like the expresion you caught. Just get rid of that feathering! lol</td>', 'I wish you hadn''t feathered so much, I found it distracting. Could be a great image. Wonder how it would look with a black background (except you might "lose" his hair that way). i do like the expresion you caught. Just get rid of that feathering! lol', '2004-03-15 21:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(622912, 64371, 806, '<td valign="top">cute is right! :)<br/>making a vertical crop out of this would accentuate her expression, and lead the viewer to her eyes and keep them there. a bit of a glare from the lights, but not too bad.<br/></td>', 'cute is right! :)making a vertical crop out of this would accentuate her expression, and lead the viewer to her eyes and keep them there. a bit of a glare from the lights, but not too bad.', '2004-03-15 21:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(622914, 64053, 12252, '<td valign="top">You''re going to take a few hits for meeting the challenge, and I''m not sure I would agree that it meets the challenge. Perhaps so. Interesting shot, but the white background (which you couldn''t help!) takes something away.</td>', 'You''re going to take a few hits for meeting the challenge, and I''m not sure I would agree that it meets the challenge. Perhaps so. Interesting shot, but the white background (which you couldn''t help!) takes something away.', '2004-03-15 21:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
