(622918, 64516, 12252, '<td valign="top">Self portraits are HARD to do. I think you''ve done VERY well here. Focus perfect. Expression perfect. Cropping perfect. A small nit about the slight shadow over the right shadow. Sweater color was a good choice to go with your hair color. Don''t you wish I could vote? If I could you''d get a 9.</td>', 'Self portraits are HARD to do. I think you''ve done VERY well here. Focus perfect. Expression perfect. Cropping perfect. A small nit about the slight shadow over the right shadow. Sweater color was a good choice to go with your hair color. Don''t you wish I could vote? If I could you''d get a 9.', '2004-03-15 21:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(622920, 64560, 2333, '<td valign="top">Very emotive portrait, great use of dramatic lighting, love the background. Wouldn''t change a thing. One of my top three for this challenge.</td>', 'Very emotive portrait, great use of dramatic lighting, love the background. Wouldn''t change a thing. One of my top three for this challenge.', '2004-03-15 21:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
