(622945, 64563, 806, '<td valign="top">this could be improved with a tight crop to eliminate the green and reddish climbing structure. same angle, just crop. also, eliminating the power line in the back would be great.<br/>Use a subtle flash to get the catch lights in his eyes. all these would do justice to this wonderful expression!</td>', 'this could be improved with a tight crop to eliminate the green and reddish climbing structure. same angle, just crop. also, eliminating the power line in the back would be great.Use a subtle flash to get the catch lights in his eyes. all these would do justice to this wonderful expression!', '2004-03-15 21:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
