(623152, 64592, 8643, '<td valign="top">Lovely pose, great skin tones.  I guess you used on camera flash which has worke quite well, although it does flatten the image a bit.  For me, the background does not really work - not well enough lit, neither in nor out of focus,so it distracts.  Against a neutral background this shot would have been even better!</td>', 'Lovely pose, great skin tones.  I guess you used on camera flash which has worke quite well, although it does flatten the image a bit.  For me, the background does not really work - not well enough lit, neither in nor out of focus,so it distracts.  Against a neutral background this shot would have been even better!', '2004-03-16 04:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(623153, 64280, 8643, '<td valign="top">I love this.  The use of colour and sharp focus to project the subject out of the dark background is superb.  I would love to know how you achieved the great lighting.  This would have worked just as well cropped square but the weight of negative space commands attention on the face.  One of the best!</td>', 'I love this.  The use of colour and sharp focus to project the subject out of the dark background is superb.  I would love to know how you achieved the great lighting.  This would have worked just as well cropped square but the weight of negative space commands attention on the face.  One of the best!', '2004-03-16 04:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(623162, 63868, 10370, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately with close-up portraits you have to get the details perfect.<br/>The stray hairs on the nose and lips, the small blemishes on the chin and cheek and the badly applied makeup really spoil this well-composed shot.</td>', 'Unfortunately with close-up portraits you have to get the details perfect.The stray hairs on the nose and lips, the small blemishes on the chin and cheek and the badly applied makeup really spoil this well-composed shot.', '2004-03-16 05:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
