(623434, 64561, 9504, '<td valign="top">I find this photo to be a candid rather than a portrait.  For a portrait, the shadows cast over the eyes don''t work for me.  And the light cast on his check and feet overexpose the photo.  Last, the background doesn''t add to the photo, but rather it detracts.  Hope this helps.</td>', 'I find this photo to be a candid rather than a portrait.  For a portrait, the shadows cast over the eyes don''t work for me.  And the light cast on his check and feet overexpose the photo.  Last, the background doesn''t add to the photo, but rather it detracts.  Hope this helps.', '2004-03-16 11:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
