(623440, 64593, 9504, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning!  It helps to have a pretty subject -- immeasurably, but of course you executed everything perfectly too!   Close contender if not the winner!  On second glance, I suspect you did a lot of touch-up work on this photo which is challenge legal.  I get a "painted" feel about it.</td>', 'Simply stunning!  It helps to have a pretty subject -- immeasurably, but of course you executed everything perfectly too!   Close contender if not the winner!  On second glance, I suspect you did a lot of touch-up work on this photo which is challenge legal.  I get a "painted" feel about it.', '2004-03-16 11:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
