(623473, 64204, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how well this will do overall, but I really like it a lot. The pose, the shoes, the expression, the b/w, the grain--all add up to a clear and strong communication about this man. 9</td>', 'I''m not sure how well this will do overall, but I really like it a lot. The pose, the shoes, the expression, the b/w, the grain--all add up to a clear and strong communication about this man. 9', '2004-03-16 11:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
