(623484, 64589, 6870, '<td valign="top">Looks like a re-creation of a Flemish painter! I like the effect and the photo. the colors are muted and appropriate. very  nice work! 9</td>', 'Looks like a re-creation of a Flemish painter! I like the effect and the photo. the colors are muted and appropriate. very  nice work! 9', '2004-03-16 11:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
