(623487, 64573, 6667, '<td valign="top">Yes she is.  Unfortunately the groom is still in the picture (and I am not trying to be funny here).  I would have like to see the same color tones all around here.  My though is that a bust size, thighter  cropping would feature her more reducing the background somewhat. It would also get rid of the right hand blurr.  But that is only my opinion. BOL</td>', 'Yes she is.  Unfortunately the groom is still in the picture (and I am not trying to be funny here).  I would have like to see the same color tones all around here.  My though is that a bust size, thighter  cropping would feature her more reducing the background somewhat. It would also get rid of the right hand blurr.  But that is only my opinion. BOL', '2004-03-16 11:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(623488, 64180, 6870, '<td valign="top">Yes, this IS a little princess! Really marvelous stuff here. Wyoming must have good light for making her tones so nice--though I might try to brighten the highlights just a teeny bit, and darken the darks just a teeny bit. Very nice work! 9</td>', 'Yes, this IS a little princess! Really marvelous stuff here. Wyoming must have good light for making her tones so nice--though I might try to brighten the highlights just a teeny bit, and darken the darks just a teeny bit. Very nice work! 9', '2004-03-16 11:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(623494, 64622, 4285, '<td valign="top">WOW. Great tones and lighting; the backlighting adds to the attractiveness of the shot. Gorgeous model with beautiful eyes helps too (I''m in love). If this doesn''t get a ribbon I''m gonna be disappointed.</td>', 'WOW. Great tones and lighting; the backlighting adds to the attractiveness of the shot. Gorgeous model with beautiful eyes helps too (I''m in love). If this doesn''t get a ribbon I''m gonna be disappointed.', '2004-03-16 11:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(623495, 64592, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting, though perhaps just a tad too bright front-on, if that makes sense. Those Tennesee gals are sure pretty! The daffodils are a great touch. 9</td>', 'Very nice lighting, though perhaps just a tad too bright front-on, if that makes sense. Those Tennesee gals are sure pretty! The daffodils are a great touch. 9', '2004-03-16 11:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(623497, 64036, 6667, '<td valign="top">Thought there were some very unique presentations in this challenge of some ordinary poses. . . until this opened.  Very, very, attractive.  I am certain I''m looking at the Blue Ribbon portrait. Impressive. Electrifying. Brilliant. Soft. Mesmerizing.  Seductive.   BOL</td>', 'Thought there were some very unique presentations in this challenge of some ordinary poses. . . until this opened.  Very, very, attractive.  I am certain I''m looking at the Blue Ribbon portrait. Impressive. Electrifying. Brilliant. Soft. Mesmerizing.  Seductive.   BOL', '2004-03-16 11:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(623498, 64490, 6667, '<td valign="top">What a sweetheart.  Beautiful capture. The colors in her sweater certainly set her off. BOL</td>', 'What a sweetheart.  Beautiful capture. The colors in her sweater certainly set her off. BOL', '2004-03-16 11:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
