(623537, 64499, 12802, '<td valign="top">A bit too soft for my liking. Nice Picture, like her strands of hair all messed up, doesn''t look too posed because of this.</td>', 'A bit too soft for my liking. Nice Picture, like her strands of hair all messed up, doesn''t look too posed because of this.', '2004-03-16 12:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(623545, 64592, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good colours, background''s great, nice idea with the hat.  Only thing I''m noticing though (that I don''t really like) is the top she is wearing.  Looks kind of busy, too much there.  If she''d had on a different colour, maybe a plain top it''d have been full marks.</td>', 'Very nice, good colours, background''s great, nice idea with the hat.  Only thing I''m noticing though (that I don''t really like) is the top she is wearing.  Looks kind of busy, too much there.  If she''d had on a different colour, maybe a plain top it''d have been full marks.', '2004-03-16 12:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(623552, 64443, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, B&amp;W is a good choice here.  As he''s looking to his left, my eyes are drawn there, think I''d have liked him looking into the camera.</td>', 'Nice shot, B&W is a good choice here.  As he''s looking to his left, my eyes are drawn there, think I''d have liked him looking into the camera.', '2004-03-16 12:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
