(623557, 64462, 12252, '<td valign="top">Looks like a rather reluctant subject! Technically very good work (composition, focus, crop, contrast, etc.). Personally, I''m distracted by the wisp of hair on her forehead.</td>', 'Looks like a rather reluctant subject! Technically very good work (composition, focus, crop, contrast, etc.). Personally, I''m distracted by the wisp of hair on her forehead.', '2004-03-16 12:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(623559, 64315, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nice job overall. Not sure about his right shoulder, it''s fuzzy and that''s either a DOF problem or not so good Photoshopping? I can''t tell. Model''s expression is excellent. I guess my only real issue with this portrait is the overall softness of the focus (except his eyes and forehead hair).</td>', 'Nice job overall. Not sure about his right shoulder, it''s fuzzy and that''s either a DOF problem or not so good Photoshopping? I can''t tell. Model''s expression is excellent. I guess my only real issue with this portrait is the overall softness of the focus (except his eyes and forehead hair).', '2004-03-16 12:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(623563, 63803, 16636, '<td valign="top">wonderfully sharp and the light fits the mood perfectly</td>', 'wonderfully sharp and the light fits the mood perfectly', '2004-03-16 12:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(623565, 64411, 12252, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how you did this, but his face is too "porcelain-y" for my taste. That''s just me, remember. It''s kind of flat or something. The little blue spot on the upper right corner is a bit distracting. I can''t vote so don''t worry, I didn''t bring down your score!</td>', 'I''m not sure how you did this, but his face is too "porcelain-y" for my taste. That''s just me, remember. It''s kind of flat or something. The little blue spot on the upper right corner is a bit distracting. I can''t vote so don''t worry, I didn''t bring down your score!', '2004-03-16 12:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(623567, 64422, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, but I think she''s leaning a bit too far. Makes me want to turn my own head to get a better viwe. The hair across her face is distracting. You''ve captured a good expression and the black and white works well.</td>', 'Nicely done, but I think she''s leaning a bit too far. Makes me want to turn my own head to get a better viwe. The hair across her face is distracting. You''ve captured a good expression and the black and white works well.', '2004-03-16 12:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
