(623569, 64361, 12252, '<td valign="top">Way, way too dark. Can''t really see her expression, the dog looks a bit upset to be held that way. The lower left corner of the photo has a black thing that''s distracting. The idea was good, but you need to work on the lighting.</td>', 'Way, way too dark. Can''t really see her expression, the dog looks a bit upset to be held that way. The lower left corner of the photo has a black thing that''s distracting. The idea was good, but you need to work on the lighting.', '2004-03-16 12:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(623574, 64652, 12252, '<td valign="top">KInda flat with a distracting background thing behind his right shoulder. There''s not enough contrast here. Cropping is nicely done yielding a good composition.</td>', 'KInda flat with a distracting background thing behind his right shoulder. There''s not enough contrast here. Cropping is nicely done yielding a good composition.', '2004-03-16 12:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(623578, 64401, 12252, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm....I think you''re on to a good idea here but would want to see more poses from different angles. The model looks impatient, or bored, or something. The lighting in the background behind the window needs a lift in the corner, her jacket sleeve gets lost there.</td>', 'Hmmmmm....I think you''re on to a good idea here but would want to see more poses from different angles. The model looks impatient, or bored, or something. The lighting in the background behind the window needs a lift in the corner, her jacket sleeve gets lost there.', '2004-03-16 12:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(623579, 64577, 12252, '<td valign="top">Hey! My eyes are getting heavy... Seriously -- I like this portrait a lot, except for the hair on her face. Good composition, good capture of a mood, nice framing, good background. Just cut out the hair... lol</td>', 'Hey! My eyes are getting heavy... Seriously -- I like this portrait a lot, except for the hair on her face. Good composition, good capture of a mood, nice framing, good background. Just cut out the hair... lol', '2004-03-16 12:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(623581, 64441, 12252, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, but the light''s a little harsh on the left side of her face, and there isn''t enough light ON her face. Looks like you took it in pretty harsh sunlight. Perhaps consider a bit of fill in flash? Loved the title but I doubt most people will get it. (I used the same word in my master''s thesis... lol)</td>', 'Pretty good, but the light''s a little harsh on the left side of her face, and there isn''t enough light ON her face. Looks like you took it in pretty harsh sunlight. Perhaps consider a bit of fill in flash? Loved the title but I doubt most people will get it. (I used the same word in my master''s thesis... lol)', '2004-03-16 12:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(623582, 64523, 12252, '<td valign="top">Great angle, good capture of her expression, nicely framed. She had to be pleased with this outcome.</td>', 'Great angle, good capture of her expression, nicely framed. She had to be pleased with this outcome.', '2004-03-16 12:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(623583, 64543, 12252, '<td valign="top">Super job! You''ve captured a lovely expression, did a wonderful job converting to black and white while preserving those baby blues, and framed nicely too. Personal nit about the frame is I would rather that the outside frame be solid, not see through. Does that make sense? But a stunning portrait in any event.</td>', 'Super job! You''ve captured a lovely expression, did a wonderful job converting to black and white while preserving those baby blues, and framed nicely too. Personal nit about the frame is I would rather that the outside frame be solid, not see through. Does that make sense? But a stunning portrait in any event.', '2004-03-16 12:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
