(623906, 64592, 16004, '<td valign="top">This is a nice enough photo - the only things I can think that might improve it is a little more light (though it might be my screen, not sure) and i''m afraid to say it, a little less hat.  I find it a little overpowering - perhaps if there was more of the model in the model / hat ratio?  7.</td>', 'This is a nice enough photo - the only things I can think that might improve it is a little more light (though it might be my screen, not sure) and i''m afraid to say it, a little less hat.  I find it a little overpowering - perhaps if there was more of the model in the model / hat ratio?  7.', '2004-03-16 17:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(623908, 64166, 14211, '<td valign="top">How did you do this?.....Love those eyes</td>', 'How did you do this?.....Love those eyes', '2004-03-16 17:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(623910, 64647, 16004, '<td valign="top">You might have been going for the fuzzy noisy look, but i''m not so sure that it works for this picture - a less noisy (neatimage tinkled) photo might of conveyed the warm comforting feel in the photo better?  An image with less noise would have given more detail, which personally i feel is semi-important in a portrait.   And finally I would have cropped the bottom off a bit - more head less blanket.  Composition though is really good, and i like the lighting. 6.</td>', 'You might have been going for the fuzzy noisy look, but i''m not so sure that it works for this picture - a less noisy (neatimage tinkled) photo might of conveyed the warm comforting feel in the photo better?  An image with less noise would have given more detail, which personally i feel is semi-important in a portrait.   And finally I would have cropped the bottom off a bit - more head less blanket.  Composition though is really good, and i like the lighting. 6.', '2004-03-16 17:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(623915, 64577, 16004, '<td valign="top">This is a really great picture, one of my top three from the challenge.  composition and lighting (to me) appears really spot on.  10</td>', 'This is a really great picture, one of my top three from the challenge.  composition and lighting (to me) appears really spot on.  10', '2004-03-16 17:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(623918, 64280, 16004, '<td valign="top">A very excellent submission - though only slight teething problem for me is the very blackness of the guys over-coat.  I know it can''t be helped, but if the coat were greyer (or blended in with the back ground a little less) it might have given shoulders more shape?  Still, a really good portait - 9.</td>', 'A very excellent submission - though only slight teething problem for me is the very blackness of the guys over-coat.  I know it can''t be helped, but if the coat were greyer (or blended in with the back ground a little less) it might have given shoulders more shape?  Still, a really good portait - 9.', '2004-03-16 18:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(623921, 64633, 16004, '<td valign="top">One of three tens i felt compelled to give in this weeks challenge.  Expression, composure, lighting, focus, DOF (?), everything is totally right.  I wish you could give just one picture a week an 11, for this would be it.  as it is, 10.</td>', 'One of three tens i felt compelled to give in this weeks challenge.  Expression, composure, lighting, focus, DOF (?), everything is totally right.  I wish you could give just one picture a week an 11, for this would be it.  as it is, 10.', '2004-03-16 18:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(623948, 64612, 13602, '<td valign="top">not a portrait to me</td>', 'not a portrait to me', '2004-03-16 18:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(623950, 64610, 13602, '<td valign="top">the processing or whatever  you did to this is totaly sick wrong, sorry</td>', 'the processing or whatever  you did to this is totaly sick wrong, sorry', '2004-03-16 18:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(623977, 64529, 16957, '<td valign="top">As a portrait I find this image too grainy and washed out in the highlights. It fails to move me to want to knwo more about the models</td>', 'As a portrait I find this image too grainy and washed out in the highlights. It fails to move me to want to knwo more about the models', '2004-03-16 19:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(623978, 64640, 16957, '<td valign="top">A good subject but this feels like a snapshot.  A bit more time spent on trying alternative angles and compositions would have yielded an improved image in my view.</td>', 'A good subject but this feels like a snapshot.  A bit more time spent on trying alternative angles and compositions would have yielded an improved image in my view.', '2004-03-16 19:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(623979, 64543, 16957, '<td valign="top">An attractive portrait ruined for me personally by the selective desaturation which takes away from the subject''s humanity.</td>', 'An attractive portrait ruined for me personally by the selective desaturation which takes away from the subject''s humanity.', '2004-03-16 19:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(623980, 64610, 16957, '<td valign="top">Potentially good subject (not sure about hairstyle :)) but the blurring at edges looks very unatural and adds nothing. Otherwise colours and composition are appealing.</td>', 'Potentially good subject (not sure about hairstyle :)) but the blurring at edges looks very unatural and adds nothing. Otherwise colours and composition are appealing.', '2004-03-16 19:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(623984, 64371, 16957, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nicely framed against dark backgroudn makign subject prominent. Image suggests that flash was used though (?) which results in a rather unattracrtive highlight on forehead.</td>', 'Good composition, nicely framed against dark backgroudn makign subject prominent. Image suggests that flash was used though (?) which results in a rather unattracrtive highlight on forehead.', '2004-03-16 19:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(623987, 64641, 16957, '<td valign="top">A good subject but you are too close to do him/her justice. It''s an unattractive image due to the model looking off frame and the awkaward angle of the mouth. Her right eye seems a bit red sugesting flash was used. Flash is deadly to human subjects. Natural light is infinitely preferable. Suggestion - place infant in a comfortable chair. Sit down 3-5 metres away, focus on her face against a neutral background, observe, wait and shoot. Sooner or later you''ll get somethign better than this without even trying too hard.</td>', 'A good subject but you are too close to do him/her justice. It''s an unattractive image due to the model looking off frame and the awkaward angle of the mouth. Her right eye seems a bit red sugesting flash was used. Flash is deadly to human subjects. Natural light is infinitely preferable. Suggestion - place infant in a comfortable chair. Sit down 3-5 metres away, focus on her face against a neutral background, observe, wait and shoot. Sooner or later you''ll get somethign better than this without even trying too hard.', '2004-03-16 19:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(623988, 64517, 16957, '<td valign="top">Hi eric!  A competent portrait but a bit bland and uninteresting.  Eric is a good model. Go for a walk with him and try some candid shots sitting, walking, talking etc. You will probably manage to capture somethign of his character.</td>', 'Hi eric!  A competent portrait but a bit bland and uninteresting.  Eric is a good model. Go for a walk with him and try some candid shots sitting, walking, talking etc. You will probably manage to capture somethign of his character.', '2004-03-16 19:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(623989, 64644, 16957, '<td valign="top">Good model but too much harsh light leading to washed out dress and too much shading in eyes (not helped by hair covering up these important features)</td>', 'Good model but too much harsh light leading to washed out dress and too much shading in eyes (not helped by hair covering up these important features)', '2004-03-16 19:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(623992, 64592, 16957, '<td valign="top">Attractive portrait. Artificial lighting does not appeal to me personally and this style of portraiture is effective for commercial purposes and for clients but rarely provides an attractive artistic image.</td>', 'Attractive portrait. Artificial lighting does not appeal to me personally and this style of portraiture is effective for commercial purposes and for clients but rarely provides an attractive artistic image.', '2004-03-16 19:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(623993, 64632, 16957, '<td valign="top">Good choice of models. God composition and effective use of DOF. Portrait let down though by impression that he is in sharper focus than her - with a narrow DOF both models need to be safely within the shallow focus plane.</td>', 'Good choice of models. God composition and effective use of DOF. Portrait let down though by impression that he is in sharper focus than her - with a narrow DOF both models need to be safely within the shallow focus plane.', '2004-03-16 19:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(623994, 64451, 16957, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and lighting. Wonderful colours and attention to key elements. Evidence of substantial time and effort. Well done.</td>', 'Lovely composition and lighting. Wonderful colours and attention to key elements. Evidence of substantial time and effort. Well done.', '2004-03-16 19:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
