(624016, 64645, 6667, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Talk about up close and personal.  I like it.  Just a tad too light. I wouldn''t have minded if it were darkened a bit.  But then agin that is my own persoonal taste. BOL</td>', 'Wow!  Talk about up close and personal.  I like it.  Just a tad too light. I wouldn''t have minded if it were darkened a bit.  But then agin that is my own persoonal taste. BOL', '2004-03-16 19:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
