(624185, 64275, 14606, '<td valign="top">lovely model. good lighting.  i think it would have been a little more engaging if we could see more of her eyes.   the eyes are the windows into the soul.  cliche but true.</td>', 'lovely model. good lighting.  i think it would have been a little more engaging if we could see more of her eyes.   the eyes are the windows into the soul.  cliche but true.', '2004-03-16 22:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
