(625173, 63803, 8624, '<td valign="top">great lighting. I find the nose ring distracting though. I''m not against piercings per se, but in this image everything is low key and muted except for this shiny spot on his nose that really is different in tone from the rest of the image.</td>', 'great lighting. I find the nose ring distracting though. I''m not against piercings per se, but in this image everything is low key and muted except for this shiny spot on his nose that really is different in tone from the rest of the image.', '2004-03-17 09:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(625178, 64589, 5728, '<td valign="top">Simply awesome! Exactly like the Vermeer painting. Clever idea and very well pulled off (10).</td>', 'Simply awesome! Exactly like the Vermeer painting. Clever idea and very well pulled off (10).', '2004-03-17 09:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(625180, 63868, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and the sweep of her hair a lot, but I would suggest cleaning up the stray hairs across her nose and especially the one down by her lip. they distract from an otherwise very nice portrait.</td>', 'I like the tones and the sweep of her hair a lot, but I would suggest cleaning up the stray hairs across her nose and especially the one down by her lip. they distract from an otherwise very nice portrait.', '2004-03-17 09:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(625182, 64180, 5728, '<td valign="top">Hehe I found your photo again Sonja :) Beautiful piece of work, I love it!</td>', 'Hehe I found your photo again Sonja :) Beautiful piece of work, I love it!', '2004-03-17 09:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(625184, 64463, 8624, '<td valign="top">love it. my favorite so far. the cigarette and the wings make the shot. pin sharp and very well composed.</td>', 'love it. my favorite so far. the cigarette and the wings make the shot. pin sharp and very well composed.', '2004-03-17 09:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(625189, 64593, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful name, beautiful girl, beautiful portrait. The composition is excellent, I love the crop. I would have dodged the whites of the eyes a little to make them a bit lighter, it would also have made the blues stand out more. Also I would have stamped out that bothersome hair going across the right eyebrow. This one will do well!</td>', 'Beautiful name, beautiful girl, beautiful portrait. The composition is excellent, I love the crop. I would have dodged the whites of the eyes a little to make them a bit lighter, it would also have made the blues stand out more. Also I would have stamped out that bothersome hair going across the right eyebrow. This one will do well!', '2004-03-17 09:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(625192, 64463, 5728, '<td valign="top">He looks cool, although I surely wouldn''t like to meet him in a dark alley! Is this a self portrait :) Wonderful photo everything is sharp, luv it.... The border is a matter of taste though I guess.</td>', 'He looks cool, although I surely wouldn''t like to meet him in a dark alley! Is this a self portrait :) Wonderful photo everything is sharp, luv it.... The border is a matter of taste though I guess.', '2004-03-17 09:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(625265, 63906, 8682, '<td valign="top">Good use of B&amp;W and good light.</td>', 'Good use of B&W and good light.', '2004-03-17 10:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(625266, 64592, 8682, '<td valign="top">What a beatitul shot! Really, a beatiful woman, and good work. I really love the use of colour.Focus is great and the pose of the model is well done, too. One of the best shots of this week. 8</td>', 'What a beatitul shot! Really, a beatiful woman, and good work. I really love the use of colour.Focus is great and the pose of the model is well done, too. One of the best shots of this week. 8', '2004-03-17 10:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(625270, 64158, 8682, '<td valign="top">wow... wow... wow.. What a fantastic portrait! I really love it. The expression of the girl is fantastic. Focus is good. The choice of b&amp;w was a fantastic choice and the light is good, too. Congrats of a fantastic work. It´s my favourite picture of this week. 10</td>', 'wow... wow... wow.. What a fantastic portrait! I really love it. The expression of the girl is fantastic. Focus is good. The choice of b&w was a fantastic choice and the light is good, too. Congrats of a fantastic work. It´s my favourite picture of this week. 10', '2004-03-17 10:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(625272, 64353, 8682, '<td valign="top">Good picture. I really love the size and the composition of the picture. 7</td>', 'Good picture. I really love the size and the composition of the picture. 7', '2004-03-17 10:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(625277, 64639, 8682, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Perhaps, the little shadow is distracting a bit.</td>', 'Good composition. Perhaps, the little shadow is distracting a bit.', '2004-03-17 10:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(625282, 64650, 8682, '<td valign="top">I think it´s an interesting portrait. I really love your use of soft focus. Furthermore, I really love the eyes, I think you didn´t eliminate the colour of his eyes, It was a fantastic effect that gives to the image more power. One of the best pictures of this week. 10</td>', 'I think it´s an interesting portrait. I really love your use of soft focus. Furthermore, I really love the eyes, I think you didn´t eliminate the colour of his eyes, It was a fantastic effect that gives to the image more power. One of the best pictures of this week. 10', '2004-03-17 10:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(625427, 64418, 15751, '<td valign="top">hahaah, this is really amusing!</td>', 'hahaah, this is really amusing!', '2004-03-17 11:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(625447, 64650, 6888, '<td valign="top">nicely done...I really like the touch of blue in the eys, very subtle...focus is sharp &amp; composition is good...well done</td>', 'nicely done...I really like the touch of blue in the eys, very subtle...focus is sharp & composition is good...well done', '2004-03-17 12:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(625452, 64639, 6888, '<td valign="top">very nice photo...hoenstly the only thing I think distracts from it being perfect is the shadow around him on the left side...</td>', 'very nice photo...hoenstly the only thing I think distracts from it being perfect is the shadow around him on the left side...', '2004-03-17 12:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(625454, 64564, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice casual shot...nice colors and I like the off center tilt</td>', 'nice casual shot...nice colors and I like the off center tilt', '2004-03-17 12:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(625455, 64422, 6888, '<td valign="top">I like the off center tilt and the b/w...DOF is good and focus is right on</td>', 'I like the off center tilt and the b/w...DOF is good and focus is right on', '2004-03-17 12:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(625456, 64491, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice shot on a hard subject to get to sit still...color is good as is the focus...nice job</td>', 'nice shot on a hard subject to get to sit still...color is good as is the focus...nice job', '2004-03-17 12:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(625459, 64523, 6888, '<td valign="top">a different point of view for a portrait...I think the feathers are too pink, they really pull the attention away from your model...her eyes are fantastic...maybe b/w would work well on this</td>', 'a different point of view for a portrait...I think the feathers are too pink, they really pull the attention away from your model...her eyes are fantastic...maybe b/w would work well on this', '2004-03-17 12:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
