(625466, 64239, 6888, '<td valign="top">with this is get more of the feeling of a fun afternoon snapshot thatn I do of a portrait</td>', 'with this is get more of the feeling of a fun afternoon snapshot thatn I do of a portrait', '2004-03-17 12:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(625468, 64593, 6888, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo...very pretty model...fantatsic eyes...everything about this is very well done...10</td>', 'beautiful photo...very pretty model...fantatsic eyes...everything about this is very well done...10', '2004-03-17 12:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(625470, 64623, 6888, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy feel to this...almost gives the feeling of an old family photo...nice tight crop and good contrasts</td>', 'I like the grainy feel to this...almost gives the feeling of an old family photo...nice tight crop and good contrasts', '2004-03-17 12:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(625475, 64530, 6888, '<td valign="top">I like the b/w...for the off center orientation I am really distracted by her hand under her chin...my eyes keep drawing back to her hand instead of to her eyes...I like everything else about this</td>', 'I like the b/w...for the off center orientation I am really distracted by her hand under her chin...my eyes keep drawing back to her hand instead of to her eyes...I like everything else about this', '2004-03-17 12:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(625477, 64315, 8159, '<td valign="top">Great capture. My only comment is that a little more DOF so that the eye in the back was sharper would''ve made this more "portrait like".</td>', 'Great capture. My only comment is that a little more DOF so that the eye in the back was sharper would''ve made this more "portrait like".', '2004-03-17 12:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(625478, 64367, 6888, '<td valign="top">interesting point of view for a portrait...your model looks aith angry or in a hurry to get the shot over with</td>', 'interesting point of view for a portrait...your model looks aith angry or in a hurry to get the shot over with', '2004-03-17 12:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(625479, 64167, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice coloring...I like the soft focus and the use of the negative space....really pulls her face out with the very dark background</td>', 'nice coloring...I like the soft focus and the use of the negative space....really pulls her face out with the very dark background', '2004-03-17 12:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(625482, 64530, 8159, '<td valign="top">To me, the tilt of the picture is such a strong contrast to "gravity-defying" look of her hair that it adds a bit of a strange feeling to the shot. I can''t quite seem to put it into words. Other than that, it is an excellent portrait.</td>', 'To me, the tilt of the picture is such a strong contrast to "gravity-defying" look of her hair that it adds a bit of a strange feeling to the shot. I can''t quite seem to put it into words. Other than that, it is an excellent portrait.', '2004-03-17 12:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(625485, 64500, 18612, '<td valign="top">A very sensual look. Great Shot!</td>', 'A very sensual look. Great Shot!', '2004-03-17 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(625489, 64618, 8159, '<td valign="top">Great subject and pose. Perhaps the shoulders turned a little bit more toward the camera instead of "sideways". Also, the skintones look a bit "too smooth" to me. I realize that young people do have very soft skin, and perhaps I am off in this observation, but it has a bit of "plasticness" to it.</td>', 'Great subject and pose. Perhaps the shoulders turned a little bit more toward the camera instead of "sideways". Also, the skintones look a bit "too smooth" to me. I realize that young people do have very soft skin, and perhaps I am off in this observation, but it has a bit of "plasticness" to it.', '2004-03-17 12:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(625493, 64652, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Perhaps a little more contrast might improve the presentation. Resetting the black point so the blacks are "really black" instead of a dark gray might be worth trying.</td>', 'Nice capture. Perhaps a little more contrast might improve the presentation. Resetting the black point so the blacks are "really black" instead of a dark gray might be worth trying.', '2004-03-17 12:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(625499, 64315, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice close up shot, one of my favorites in this challenge, I like your b&amp;w tones</td>', 'Nice close up shot, one of my favorites in this challenge, I like your b&w tones', '2004-03-17 12:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(625500, 64481, 8159, '<td valign="top">Great model! The lighting on the left side of her face (the right in the picture) is a little too harsh. Not sure if the exposure was bumped up to bring out shadow detail or not, but perhaps a reflection on her right side (to the left of the camera) could have put a little bit of fill on the left and allowed for a little better exposure without the stark highlights. Or perhaps the light on her right side just needed to be diffused a little more? In any case, still a very nice capture!</td>', 'Great model! The lighting on the left side of her face (the right in the picture) is a little too harsh. Not sure if the exposure was bumped up to bring out shadow detail or not, but perhaps a reflection on her right side (to the left of the camera) could have put a little bit of fill on the left and allowed for a little better exposure without the stark highlights. Or perhaps the light on her right side just needed to be diffused a little more? In any case, still a very nice capture!', '2004-03-17 12:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(625507, 64593, 8159, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent capture. I can''t think of anything I can suggest changing. The tight crop works well here, and really shows off those great blue eyes! Nice work.</td>', 'This is an excellent capture. I can''t think of anything I can suggest changing. The tight crop works well here, and really shows off those great blue eyes! Nice work.', '2004-03-17 12:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(625513, 64499, 4793, '<td valign="top">Very nice close up, try shooting this again with a solid back ground and I think you will  be pleased with a different look. Nice work keep it up. And a most beautiful subject, is she always so serious?</td>', 'Very nice close up, try shooting this again with a solid back ground and I think you will  be pleased with a different look. Nice work keep it up. And a most beautiful subject, is she always so serious?', '2004-03-17 12:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(625515, 64523, 4793, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, different angle, very nice.</td>', 'I like this shot, different angle, very nice.', '2004-03-17 12:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(625516, 64370, 8159, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I have NO idea whose entry this might be, so let me just say: what a cute kid! The exposure is spot-on and looks great. The expression is perfect and the little yellow dog? moose? whatever? is a great modifier in this shot. The only thing I might have done is cropped it a little closer, but I''m not taking any points off for that. Great job!</td>', 'Hmm, I have NO idea whose entry this might be, so let me just say: what a cute kid! The exposure is spot-on and looks great. The expression is perfect and the little yellow dog? moose? whatever? is a great modifier in this shot. The only thing I might have done is cropped it a little closer, but I''m not taking any points off for that. Great job!', '2004-03-17 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(625526, 64112, 8159, '<td valign="top">Great attempt at meeting this challenge. The backlit-hair thing can work very well in a portrait situation, but to me it looks a bit over-done here, so much so that it has turned a large portion of her hair yellowish-white. I also probably would have cropped this to a portrait orientation. I think with a  little diffusion on the backlighting, you can end up with a great shot!</td>', 'Great attempt at meeting this challenge. The backlit-hair thing can work very well in a portrait situation, but to me it looks a bit over-done here, so much so that it has turned a large portion of her hair yellowish-white. I also probably would have cropped this to a portrait orientation. I think with a  little diffusion on the backlighting, you can end up with a great shot!', '2004-03-17 12:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(625530, 64563, 8159, '<td valign="top">I think a little fill-flash to get some catch-lights in the eyes would add a lot to this otherwise great shot that captured a  lot of emotion.</td>', 'I think a little fill-flash to get some catch-lights in the eyes would add a lot to this otherwise great shot that captured a  lot of emotion.', '2004-03-17 12:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(625532, 64645, 8159, '<td valign="top">To me, this looks a little too dark on her left side (camera right). Perhaps a reflector would add some fill to bring that side of her face out of the shadows. Other than that, a great attempt a meeting the challenge head-on.</td>', 'To me, this looks a little too dark on her left side (camera right). Perhaps a reflector would add some fill to bring that side of her face out of the shadows. Other than that, a great attempt a meeting the challenge head-on.', '2004-03-17 12:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(625533, 64592, 4793, '<td valign="top">You have a beautiful subject here, i would like to see an even closer shot of her in this same pose, croping down almost to the brim of the hat, on the shoulder side to the hair, and have her remove the rings! your focal point should be this beautiful lady. Your clarity and colors here are good. 9</td>', 'You have a beautiful subject here, i would like to see an even closer shot of her in this same pose, croping down almost to the brim of the hat, on the shoulder side to the hair, and have her remove the rings! your focal point should be this beautiful lady. Your clarity and colors here are good. 9', '2004-03-17 12:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(625534, 64180, 8159, '<td valign="top">Great subject for this challenge! My only comment is that the image has a greenish-cast on my (calibrated) monitor. Not sure if that was intentional or not, but wanted to point it out just in case. Other than that, can''t think of anything else I would change! Nice job.</td>', 'Great subject for this challenge! My only comment is that the image has a greenish-cast on my (calibrated) monitor. Not sure if that was intentional or not, but wanted to point it out just in case. Other than that, can''t think of anything else I would change! Nice job.', '2004-03-17 12:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(625536, 64361, 11895, '<td valign="top">I really like this but would score it higher if I could see the subject''s face better</td>', 'I really like this but would score it higher if I could see the subject''s face better', '2004-03-17 12:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(625538, 64462, 4793, '<td valign="top">Very nice b&amp;w, I would love to see this not cropped so tightly, so serious looking!</td>', 'Very nice b&w, I would love to see this not cropped so tightly, so serious looking!', '2004-03-17 12:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(625540, 64566, 4793, '<td valign="top">What did you feed this child sour pickles, love it.</td>', 'What did you feed this child sour pickles, love it.', '2004-03-17 12:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(625554, 64625, 4793, '<td valign="top">Would love to see this with a solid back ground, your composition is perfect, perhaps it is my monitor, her face looks to red, keep up the good work.</td>', 'Would love to see this with a solid back ground, your composition is perfect, perhaps it is my monitor, her face looks to red, keep up the good work.', '2004-03-17 12:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(625555, 64592, 8159, '<td valign="top">First, let me say great model, great pose, great location for an "environmental" portrait. Meets the challenge very well. My only comment would be that the lighting looks a little "off". From the location of the catchlights in her eyes, it looks like you may have been using a direct flash? This could be part of it, or maybe it is just that the flash was too strong and didn''t allow enough "ambient" exposure for the background? In any event, nice job.</td>', 'First, let me say great model, great pose, great location for an "environmental" portrait. Meets the challenge very well. My only comment would be that the lighting looks a little "off". From the location of the catchlights in her eyes, it looks like you may have been using a direct flash? This could be part of it, or maybe it is just that the flash was too strong and didn''t allow enough "ambient" exposure for the background? In any event, nice job.', '2004-03-17 12:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(625561, 64036, 4793, '<td valign="top">The eyes grab you, a beautiful well composed shot, you took artistic license, I like that very much, some creativity for a change. Great colors. 10</td>', 'The eyes grab you, a beautiful well composed shot, you took artistic license, I like that very much, some creativity for a change. Great colors. 10', '2004-03-17 12:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(625565, 64525, 8159, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a good portrait, but the post-processing or in-camera effect has turned this more into "digital art" than a photograph.</td>', 'I think this could have been a good portrait, but the post-processing or in-camera effect has turned this more into "digital art" than a photograph.', '2004-03-17 12:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(625571, 64500, 8159, '<td valign="top">Great model, nice pose! On my (calibrated) monitor, this has a "yellowish" tone to it that seems a little strange, so I wanted to mention it. (The grayscale on the voting page looks nice and gray in comparison). Adding a little bit of blue to the picture might help balance out the tones? Other than that, good job at meeting this challenge.</td>', 'Great model, nice pose! On my (calibrated) monitor, this has a "yellowish" tone to it that seems a little strange, so I wanted to mention it. (The grayscale on the voting page looks nice and gray in comparison). Adding a little bit of blue to the picture might help balance out the tones? Other than that, good job at meeting this challenge.', '2004-03-17 12:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(625573, 64036, 8159, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is way too much "digital art" for me.</td>', 'Sorry, but this is way too much "digital art" for me.', '2004-03-17 12:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(625578, 64573, 8159, '<td valign="top">Great model and a great opportunity for a portrait. Unfortunately, this looks too candid to me. The groom (?) in the background is especially distracting in this case. If you could have gotten the bride to stand 5 or 6 feet from a wall, set a large aperture on your camera and taken a shot, you would have had a potentially terrific portrait.</td>', 'Great model and a great opportunity for a portrait. Unfortunately, this looks too candid to me. The groom (?) in the background is especially distracting in this case. If you could have gotten the bride to stand 5 or 6 feet from a wall, set a large aperture on your camera and taken a shot, you would have had a potentially terrific portrait.', '2004-03-17 13:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(625581, 64610, 8159, '<td valign="top">To me, the fuzziness around the subject detracts from this shot. It looks like you may have been attempting to remove the background? Better to try and get the background close to what you want at exposure time if at all possible. The lighting looks a bit flat as well, especially the bright area on the forehead. If you can''t move your flash off the camera, perhaps you could try some natural light portraits with some white foamcore as a reflector for fill on the opposite side.</td>', 'To me, the fuzziness around the subject detracts from this shot. It looks like you may have been attempting to remove the background? Better to try and get the background close to what you want at exposure time if at all possible. The lighting looks a bit flat as well, especially the bright area on the forehead. If you can''t move your flash off the camera, perhaps you could try some natural light portraits with some white foamcore as a reflector for fill on the opposite side.', '2004-03-17 13:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(625584, 64327, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful abstract portrait :)  Excellent idea and the lighting is great.. = 10</td>', 'This is a beautiful abstract portrait :)  Excellent idea and the lighting is great.. = 10', '2004-03-17 13:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(625598, 64632, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful smiles. Great teeth!</td>', 'Beautiful smiles. Great teeth!', '2004-03-17 13:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(625606, 64528, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. It''s a definate 10 from me.</td>', 'I really like this shot. It''s a definate 10 from me.', '2004-03-17 13:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(625614, 64327, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, and unique for the challenge. 10</td>', 'Great lighting, and unique for the challenge. 10', '2004-03-17 13:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(625674, 64479, 6019, '<td valign="top">This little fellow doesnt look very happy! I do like the use of his hand in the pic, the little bit of yellow in the background is distracting...</td>', 'This little fellow doesnt look very happy! I do like the use of his hand in the pic, the little bit of yellow in the background is distracting...', '2004-03-17 14:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
