(625827, 64534, 4793, '<td valign="top">A beautiful b&amp;w photo your b&amp;w tones,composition and subject are wonderful but your back ground needs to be blurred with dof or use a solid back drop. In my opinion with the background fixed this would be a stunning shot.</td>', 'A beautiful b&w photo your b&w tones,composition and subject are wonderful but your back ground needs to be blurred with dof or use a solid back drop. In my opinion with the background fixed this would be a stunning shot.', '2004-03-17 15:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
