(626129, 64564, 15986, '<td valign="top">Very cute, looks like a happy dude.  I would bring up the black point a bit to lose some of the pattern in the background.</td>', 'Very cute, looks like a happy dude.  I would bring up the black point a bit to lose some of the pattern in the background.', '2004-03-17 17:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
