(626511, 64598, 4494, '<td valign="top">The background sheet is awefull.  It''s all wrinkled and sagging.   And the top of the instrument is cutoff!   And the subject looks like she''s standing on one leg for some reason.  LOL.</td>', 'The background sheet is awefull.  It''s all wrinkled and sagging.   And the top of the instrument is cutoff!   And the subject looks like she''s standing on one leg for some reason.  LOL.', '2004-03-17 20:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
