(626514, 64167, 4494, '<td valign="top">The head seems a little cutoff.  Nice blending of the body and background into black while maintaining the lighting on the face.</td>', 'The head seems a little cutoff.  Nice blending of the body and background into black while maintaining the lighting on the face.', '2004-03-17 20:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
