(626729, 64036, 6888, '<td valign="top">although this does''t fit my tastes, I have to say that it is very well done...the colors all go together nicely...technically the only thing I can see that I don''t like is in her top it looks like maybe too much saturation on the blue...but her eyes sell this shot - they are fantastic...</td>', 'although this does''t fit my tastes, I have to say that it is very well done...the colors all go together nicely...technically the only thing I can see that I don''t like is in her top it looks like maybe too much saturation on the blue...but her eyes sell this shot - they are fantastic...', '2004-03-17 23:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
