(626732, 64494, 6888, '<td valign="top">nothing is in focus and the photo is too small to get a good view of it to review</td>', 'nothing is in focus and the photo is too small to get a good view of it to review', '2004-03-17 23:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(626733, 64459, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely portrait of a beautiful young lady and I love the concept here of having the painting in the background to which the subject is set against.  I do, however, think there are improvements that can be made.  First, I''m wondering if the painting has real relevence to the subject, in terms of, likeness or some kind of similarity.  Also, I don''t like the fact that the head of the subject in the painting was cut off.  I do love the pose of your litte woman, and she is darling, but I would have preferred crisper focus on her face (it appears that the focus is better on the side of her face) and I also would have preferred that she wasn''t wearing the shiny chrome barrette and red pony tail holder, both of which I find distracting. And also (sorry this is so long :),  I think she should be wearing a colored blouse that matches better with the painting above and a color more subdued than the one she is wearing, which is bolder and does''nt match her lipstick or the painting. I hope this helps. 8</td>', 'This is a lovely portrait of a beautiful young lady and I love the concept here of having the painting in the background to which the subject is set against.  I do, however, think there are improvements that can be made.  First, I''m wondering if the painting has real relevence to the subject, in terms of, likeness or some kind of similarity.  Also, I don''t like the fact that the head of the subject in the painting was cut off.  I do love the pose of your litte woman, and she is darling, but I would have preferred crisper focus on her face (it appears that the focus is better on the side of her face) and I also would have preferred that she wasn''t wearing the shiny chrome barrette and red pony tail holder, both of which I find distracting. And also (sorry this is so long :),  I think she should be wearing a colored blouse that matches better with the painting above and a color more subdued than the one she is wearing, which is bolder and does''nt match her lipstick or the painting. I hope this helps. 8', '2004-03-17 23:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(626736, 64327, 6888, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what this is so I can only judge it based on wheteher it meets the challenge or not...looks more like still life than portraiture</td>', 'I am not sure what this is so I can only judge it based on wheteher it meets the challenge or not...looks more like still life than portraiture', '2004-03-17 23:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(626738, 64166, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice fun shot...I am sure future boyfirends will enjoy seeing this one</td>', 'nice fun shot...I am sure future boyfirends will enjoy seeing this one', '2004-03-17 23:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(626739, 64527, 6888, '<td valign="top">wow...she has the most beautiful eyes...you are just drawn right into them...the colors of her headress are very complimentary to her eyes...10</td>', 'wow...she has the most beautiful eyes...you are just drawn right into them...the colors of her headress are very complimentary to her eyes...10', '2004-03-17 23:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(626750, 64263, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like this portrait alot as I find the subject compelling and interesting to look at...especially his hair, which imo carries the picture.  The lighting is too harsh and you''ve lost detail in parts of the face and shoulders. Also, not too crazy about the green color of his eyes, as they look unnaturally colored.  I don''t think the background works here as the color doesn''t match the eye color and it''s print is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'I like this portrait alot as I find the subject compelling and interesting to look at...especially his hair, which imo carries the picture.  The lighting is too harsh and you''ve lost detail in parts of the face and shoulders. Also, not too crazy about the green color of his eyes, as they look unnaturally colored.  I don''t think the background works here as the color doesn''t match the eye color and it''s print is somewhat distracting.', '2004-03-17 23:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(626760, 63885, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very cute...I love her!  Her red hair is awesome. Photographically, you have mixed lighting that is casting yellow on most of your subject.  (looks like daylight mixed with incandescent lighting).  Her hands are of two different colored tones and I wish there were more light shining on her cute face.</td>', 'Very cute...I love her!  Her red hair is awesome. Photographically, you have mixed lighting that is casting yellow on most of your subject.  (looks like daylight mixed with incandescent lighting).  Her hands are of two different colored tones and I wish there were more light shining on her cute face.', '2004-03-17 23:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(626769, 64401, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful woman and I love the way you''ve framed her in the window and with the tree.  I do find this image to be too busy.  Though I would imagine this to be your intention, I don''t like her distant stare as I find it to be almost vacant, as if she''s not looking at anything in particular.  Also, she is wearing too much black that is all blending together.</td>', 'Beautiful woman and I love the way you''ve framed her in the window and with the tree.  I do find this image to be too busy.  Though I would imagine this to be your intention, I don''t like her distant stare as I find it to be almost vacant, as if she''s not looking at anything in particular.  Also, she is wearing too much black that is all blending together.', '2004-03-17 23:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(626778, 64570, 5822, '<td valign="top">Is the uneven and graded lighting the reason for the monitors being of different color temp?</td>', 'Is the uneven and graded lighting the reason for the monitors being of different color temp?', '2004-03-18 00:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(626873, 64481, 9285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot...  I love the setup... <br/>But the hair on her left seems a little messy... still a 8 for me</td>', 'Beautiful shot...  I love the setup... But the hair on her left seems a little messy... still a 8 for me', '2004-03-18 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(626876, 64172, 9285, '<td valign="top">Nice... but the colours'' a little flat... like the composition... a 7</td>', 'Nice... but the colours'' a little flat... like the composition... a 7', '2004-03-18 01:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(626890, 64441, 5822, '<td valign="top">This beautiful woman with lovely flowing locks I''m sure has raised the spirits of many a man but I''m trying to figure out what embodiment of spirit she is expressing in the image.  Is that spirit determination and will?; is it religious in nature?; Is it strength of character?  Her look is void and so it''s hard to tell and I am left with the only clue I could find, which is what appears to be a religious shawl that she is clutching.  What significance this has I''m not sure but the lines of the cloth give a strong graphic element, probably the only strong point in the image.  Her clothes are plain and she also suffers from being half in light and half in shadow, as well as,  being underexposed and a green cast to her face. I would have preferred to have seen her wear some sort of religious or cultural/ethnic garb instead of the sweatshirt she is wearing and to have her hair brushed better.</td>', 'This beautiful woman with lovely flowing locks I''m sure has raised the spirits of many a man but I''m trying to figure out what embodiment of spirit she is expressing in the image.  Is that spirit determination and will?; is it religious in nature?; Is it strength of character?  Her look is void and so it''s hard to tell and I am left with the only clue I could find, which is what appears to be a religious shawl that she is clutching.  What significance this has I''m not sure but the lines of the cloth give a strong graphic element, probably the only strong point in the image.  Her clothes are plain and she also suffers from being half in light and half in shadow, as well as,  being underexposed and a green cast to her face. I would have preferred to have seen her wear some sort of religious or cultural/ethnic garb instead of the sweatshirt she is wearing and to have her hair brushed better.', '2004-03-18 02:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(626932, 64422, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful photo. Did you tilt it after talking it? The reason I ask is that her hair seems to be defying gravity, with the angle of her head I don''t think her hair would fall that way naturally.</td>', 'What a beautiful photo. Did you tilt it after talking it? The reason I ask is that her hair seems to be defying gravity, with the angle of her head I don''t think her hair would fall that way naturally.', '2004-03-18 04:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(626933, 64543, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really a lovely photo. Leaving the eye blue is the perfect accent.</td>', 'Really a lovely photo. Leaving the eye blue is the perfect accent.', '2004-03-18 04:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(626940, 64593, 8139, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I like the cropping here, making this portrait well balanced.</td>', 'Beautiful. I like the cropping here, making this portrait well balanced.', '2004-03-18 05:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(626942, 64530, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your photo is really nice, I like the focus and the wet look on the lips. I guess you must have rotated the photo after you took it as her hair looks like it is defying gravity. When a girl with long hair tips her head, her hair falls to the side - for some reason when you first glance at this photo you get that feeling -- what''s wrong with this picture - like in Games Magazine.</td>', 'Your photo is really nice, I like the focus and the wet look on the lips. I guess you must have rotated the photo after you took it as her hair looks like it is defying gravity. When a girl with long hair tips her head, her hair falls to the side - for some reason when you first glance at this photo you get that feeling -- what''s wrong with this picture - like in Games Magazine.', '2004-03-18 05:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
