(626984, 64626, 6771, '<td valign="top">I do like the range of grays you got on this.  Not being able to see the females eyes, is a bit distracting, especially because of the reflections.</td>', 'I do like the range of grays you got on this.  Not being able to see the females eyes, is a bit distracting, especially because of the reflections.', '2004-03-18 06:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
