(626986, 64167, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very nice low key (mostly) shot. The focus is the right amount of softness.  the just barely percievable clothing outlines are a little distracting, but makes you look into the picture more.  Her eyes really draw you in.  I would have taken the "dots" on her eyes out.</td>', 'Very nice low key (mostly) shot. The focus is the right amount of softness.  the just barely percievable clothing outlines are a little distracting, but makes you look into the picture more.  Her eyes really draw you in.  I would have taken the "dots" on her eyes out.', '2004-03-18 06:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(626987, 63931, 6771, '<td valign="top">very nice picture and lighting.  I would like to see a little less of the negative space to the left and put the orientation in portrait mode.</td>', 'very nice picture and lighting.  I would like to see a little less of the negative space to the left and put the orientation in portrait mode.', '2004-03-18 06:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(626989, 64463, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  The hair is cut off.  would like to have had it all in frame.  actually what is more interesting is what the rest of this guy looked like.  but then again, maybe I don''t wanna know</td>', 'Very interesting.  The hair is cut off.  would like to have had it all in frame.  actually what is more interesting is what the rest of this guy looked like.  but then again, maybe I don''t wanna know', '2004-03-18 06:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(626990, 64036, 6771, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting.  almost looks like it was done under black light.  I really like the colors and pose.  The only thing that is distracting, is the color under her eyes.  they make her appear like a heroin addict.  Very tired and worn out.</td>', 'This is very interesting.  almost looks like it was done under black light.  I really like the colors and pose.  The only thing that is distracting, is the color under her eyes.  they make her appear like a heroin addict.  Very tired and worn out.', '2004-03-18 06:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(626992, 64564, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very great catch, focus, and lighting.  I am just wondering what he is saying, singing, expressing.  Great job</td>', 'Very great catch, focus, and lighting.  I am just wondering what he is saying, singing, expressing.  Great job', '2004-03-18 06:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(626994, 64474, 6771, '<td valign="top">almost like floating in nothingness.  there seems to be an area on her right arm that has much more light than the rest.  I would have liked to seen a bit more soft diffuse light up onto the face.  there seems to be a little aberration on the bottom of her right forearm, also</td>', 'almost like floating in nothingness.  there seems to be an area on her right arm that has much more light than the rest.  I would have liked to seen a bit more soft diffuse light up onto the face.  there seems to be a little aberration on the bottom of her right forearm, also', '2004-03-18 06:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(627001, 64275, 6771, '<td valign="top">I find my eye drawn towards her ear.  must be the bright area on it.  I want my eyes drawn to the eye, but it is looking WAY away, to where it is hard to even distinguish a pupil.  A soft focus would work on here throughout.  or a larger DOF to get everything in focus (nose to eye are pretty soft compared to the L shoulder</td>', 'I find my eye drawn towards her ear.  must be the bright area on it.  I want my eyes drawn to the eye, but it is looking WAY away, to where it is hard to even distinguish a pupil.  A soft focus would work on here throughout.  or a larger DOF to get everything in focus (nose to eye are pretty soft compared to the L shoulder', '2004-03-18 06:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(627007, 64610, 6771, '<td valign="top">Now this is one interesting cat.  Is that Dapper Dan Pomade in his hair?  sure he has enough?  (C;  The lighting is very harsh and bright.  Makes him look very pasty in spots.  the soft edge around the head and shoulders is VERY distracting and invades onto his face.</td>', 'Now this is one interesting cat.  Is that Dapper Dan Pomade in his hair?  sure he has enough?  (C;  The lighting is very harsh and bright.  Makes him look very pasty in spots.  the soft edge around the head and shoulders is VERY distracting and invades onto his face.', '2004-03-18 06:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(627010, 64376, 6771, '<td valign="top">Which one is the doll?  BOTH!  Very nice capture.  has a very soft feel to it, but can''t really tell if filters or anything used.  Lighting is great.  great job.</td>', 'Which one is the doll?  BOTH!  Very nice capture.  has a very soft feel to it, but can''t really tell if filters or anything used.  Lighting is great.  great job.', '2004-03-18 06:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(627013, 64574, 6771, '<td valign="top">Has a good softness to it.  bringing the subject out and away form the background would give a softer feel and get rid of the shadow.  Being able to see her eyes would make this a bit better shot IMO.  Also squaring up the shoulders</td>', 'Has a good softness to it.  bringing the subject out and away form the background would give a softer feel and get rid of the shadow.  Being able to see her eyes would make this a bit better shot IMO.  Also squaring up the shoulders', '2004-03-18 06:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(627021, 64502, 6771, '<td valign="top">I am not sure that this qualifys as a portrait for me, but photowise it is not too bad.  Needs work on the horizon line ( a litle skewed)  a slightly different angle to maybe get the pillars almost looking like mirror images, may have given a better impression to me</td>', 'I am not sure that this qualifys as a portrait for me, but photowise it is not too bad.  Needs work on the horizon line ( a litle skewed)  a slightly different angle to maybe get the pillars almost looking like mirror images, may have given a better impression to me', '2004-03-18 06:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
