(627076, 63803, 14453, '<td valign="top">my favorite. Beautiful picture, great work with light.  9</td>', 'my favorite. Beautiful picture, great work with light.  9', '2004-03-18 07:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(627122, 64517, 14386, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on top might help. Having said that, the colors in this one are very distinct. Overall a good shot but needs a more unconventional approach, IMHO.</td>', 'A tighter crop on top might help. Having said that, the colors in this one are very distinct. Overall a good shot but needs a more unconventional approach, IMHO.', '2004-03-18 08:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(627126, 64632, 14386, '<td valign="top">Nice tight cropping. Good expressions though the girl is a bit sfter than the boy.</td>', 'Nice tight cropping. Good expressions though the girl is a bit sfter than the boy.', '2004-03-18 08:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(627155, 64036, 10149, '<td valign="top">Very Good, I really like this one, 10</td>', 'Very Good, I really like this one, 10', '2004-03-18 09:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(627157, 64366, 10149, '<td valign="top">very good, 9</td>', 'very good, 9', '2004-03-18 09:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(627167, 64441, 10149, '<td valign="top">very good, 10</td>', 'very good, 10', '2004-03-18 09:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(627179, 64598, 10149, '<td valign="top">Nice Pic, 9</td>', 'Nice Pic, 9', '2004-03-18 09:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(627188, 64653, 18661, '<td valign="top">I love the way the light is shining in her hair! Great portrait!</td>', 'I love the way the light is shining in her hair! Great portrait!', '2004-03-18 09:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(627287, 64463, 6388, '<td valign="top">aside from the border this rocks :)  I don''t wanna know the story behind it either.  I  might have burned the background a bit so it wasn''t so harsh, or perhaps used a fill-flash when shooting to speed up the shutter, but that just me.  Either way, I like it.  Pedro</td>', 'aside from the border this rocks :)  I don''t wanna know the story behind it either.  I  might have burned the background a bit so it wasn''t so harsh, or perhaps used a fill-flash when shooting to speed up the shutter, but that just me.  Either way, I like it.  Pedro', '2004-03-18 11:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(627290, 64462, 6388, '<td valign="top">Did you convert this to BW using the channel mixer?  it has that unusual quality that the channel mixer can give because it tends to overdo the red channel a bit. It makes the whites too white and the darks too dark (in this picture i lose some detail in the eyes that I''d like to see, but if you lightened it the robe would blow out). I tend to use the greyscale/duotone method and have had some nice results.<br/>Good luck,<br/>Pedro</td>', 'Did you convert this to BW using the channel mixer?  it has that unusual quality that the channel mixer can give because it tends to overdo the red channel a bit. It makes the whites too white and the darks too dark (in this picture i lose some detail in the eyes that I''d like to see, but if you lightened it the robe would blow out). I tend to use the greyscale/duotone method and have had some nice results.Good luck,Pedro', '2004-03-18 11:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(627291, 64490, 6388, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  i love the solitary green bush in the background and the way it ties her sweater in with the background.  It''ll look great on your wall :)</td>', 'beautiful.  i love the solitary green bush in the background and the way it ties her sweater in with the background.  It''ll look great on your wall :)', '2004-03-18 11:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(627294, 63965, 6388, '<td valign="top">the border looks odd being thicker at the bottom (and maybe the top, i can''t tell). the pic itself is nice - a little flat (which is hard to avoid with stage lights because they''re so bright).  I might adjust the curves a little to highlight some facial features, and maybe a little dodge/burn around the eyes.  Glasses are a pain to shoot.  Composition is very nice - great pose and expression.<br/>Pedro</td>', 'the border looks odd being thicker at the bottom (and maybe the top, i can''t tell). the pic itself is nice - a little flat (which is hard to avoid with stage lights because they''re so bright).  I might adjust the curves a little to highlight some facial features, and maybe a little dodge/burn around the eyes.  Glasses are a pain to shoot.  Composition is very nice - great pose and expression.Pedro', '2004-03-18 11:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(627298, 64112, 6388, '<td valign="top">nice effect, albeit a little overdone on the left part of the pic.  I really like the glow on the right (our right), and a little burning on the left and it would mesh nicely. good job.<br/>Pedro</td>', 'nice effect, albeit a little overdone on the left part of the pic.  I really like the glow on the right (our right), and a little burning on the left and it would mesh nicely. good job.Pedro', '2004-03-18 11:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(627300, 64118, 6388, '<td valign="top">a little creative dodging of  of his face, and/or burning of his arm/guitar and this would be fabulous.  i like the crop, and love the look on his face.<br/>Pedro</td>', 'a little creative dodging of  of his face, and/or burning of his arm/guitar and this would be fabulous.  i like the crop, and love the look on his face.Pedro', '2004-03-18 11:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(627303, 64459, 18485, '<td valign="top">lovely girl, nice shot.  distracting background.</td>', 'lovely girl, nice shot.  distracting background.', '2004-03-18 11:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(627305, 64502, 18485, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting candid...not a portrait.</td>', 'this is an interesting candid...not a portrait.', '2004-03-18 11:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(627329, 64650, 7908, '<td valign="top">I like that you did the eye coloring in a more subtle fashion than many of the other entries. Also like the lighting ... dramatic, yet appropriate.</td>', 'I like that you did the eye coloring in a more subtle fashion than many of the other entries. Also like the lighting ... dramatic, yet appropriate.', '2004-03-18 12:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(627337, 64204, 7908, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully composed. It looks like you tried for a very deep DOF, but you lost a little crispness in his shoes. If it had worked and it was all in focus, it would have been great. But, since you didn''t quite get it all, maybe it would be better with a little less depth ... then it would look purposeful, at least.</td>', 'Wonderfully composed. It looks like you tried for a very deep DOF, but you lost a little crispness in his shoes. If it had worked and it was all in focus, it would have been great. But, since you didn''t quite get it all, maybe it would be better with a little less depth ... then it would look purposeful, at least.', '2004-03-18 12:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(627351, 64353, 13384, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot at all, but the more I look at it the crop seems off a bit - kinda hard to put my finger on it ...</td>', 'Not a bad shot at all, but the more I look at it the crop seems off a bit - kinda hard to put my finger on it ...', '2004-03-18 12:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(627355, 63788, 6888, '<td valign="top">the shaky out of focus effect just doesn''t work</td>', 'the shaky out of focus effect just doesn''t work', '2004-03-18 12:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(627356, 64409, 6888, '<td valign="top">probably intention but nothing is really in focus...makes it hard to concentrate on the shot...the pose is good as is the b/w</td>', 'probably intention but nothing is really in focus...makes it hard to concentrate on the shot...the pose is good as is the b/w', '2004-03-18 12:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(627358, 64370, 13384, '<td valign="top">Classic Toddler shot and set up - could of been a pro set up for sure.  just perhaps a 1/2 overexposed.  good work.</td>', 'Classic Toddler shot and set up - could of been a pro set up for sure.  just perhaps a 1/2 overexposed.  good work.', '2004-03-18 12:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(627359, 64563, 6888, '<td valign="top">this is a nice casual shot...more of a snapshot feel to it than a portrait</td>', 'this is a nice casual shot...more of a snapshot feel to it than a portrait', '2004-03-18 12:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(627361, 64626, 6888, '<td valign="top">the b/w is very nice...this is a really good shot except for the reflection in her sunglasses...that is where my eye gets dran to and takes away from the shot</td>', 'the b/w is very nice...this is a really good shot except for the reflection in her sunglasses...that is where my eye gets dran to and takes away from the shot', '2004-03-18 12:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(627362, 64622, 13384, '<td valign="top">It''s easy to over do the catch light and you are on the right track.  One of the features that make a wall hung portrait, is the depth "in" character.  Keep on this track for sure.</td>', 'It''s easy to over do the catch light and you are on the right track.  One of the features that make a wall hung portrait, is the depth "in" character.  Keep on this track for sure.', '2004-03-18 12:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(627364, 64651, 6888, '<td valign="top">nicely done...I like the b/w, the pose looks natural, simple shot that looks great</td>', 'nicely done...I like the b/w, the pose looks natural, simple shot that looks great', '2004-03-18 12:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(627366, 64463, 6888, '<td valign="top">techincally a good shot...the model is a bit odd, but hey it''s the Green time o year...the border is a bit distracting as well</td>', 'techincally a good shot...the model is a bit odd, but hey it''s the Green time o year...the border is a bit distracting as well', '2004-03-18 12:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(627367, 64527, 13384, '<td valign="top">This is good all around, depth, expression, exposure fall off could be be just ever so much deeper and I mean very slightly.  Good color and texutre, DOF is spot on.  its at the top of my voting...</td>', 'This is good all around, depth, expression, exposure fall off could be be just ever so much deeper and I mean very slightly.  Good color and texutre, DOF is spot on.  its at the top of my voting...', '2004-03-18 12:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(627368, 64321, 6888, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot...the only distractin is the line down the left side, maybe the doorway?...other than that this is very good</td>', 'I really like this shot...the only distractin is the line down the left side, maybe the doorway?...other than that this is very good', '2004-03-18 12:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(627371, 64570, 6888, '<td valign="top">interesting photo, but it doesn''t work for me as a portrait for the challenge...the border distracts from the photo as well</td>', 'interesting photo, but it doesn''t work for me as a portrait for the challenge...the border distracts from the photo as well', '2004-03-18 12:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(627372, 64031, 6888, '<td valign="top">this would be nice is the topic was advertising or stock photo, but not for portrait</td>', 'this would be nice is the topic was advertising or stock photo, but not for portrait', '2004-03-18 12:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(627375, 63838, 6888, '<td valign="top">the bold border is a bit distracting...the crop you used is really nice...a good contrast with the very white background and the darkness of your model...very nice...good luck</td>', 'the bold border is a bit distracting...the crop you used is really nice...a good contrast with the very white background and the darkness of your model...very nice...good luck', '2004-03-18 12:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(627376, 64118, 6888, '<td valign="top">this would be great to use on promotion material for this musician...the crop is nice and the expression on his face is great</td>', 'this would be great to use on promotion material for this musician...the crop is nice and the expression on his face is great', '2004-03-18 12:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(627377, 64517, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice casual shot...the colors are good, nice blurring of the background...well done</td>', 'nice casual shot...the colors are good, nice blurring of the background...well done', '2004-03-18 12:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(627378, 64530, 13384, '<td valign="top">I think that photographically it''s a sound work, but to me the angle is far too steep and that the hair in the face is a bit too excessive.  I like the B/W tones and the background as well as the fall off...you know i just saved and rotated it more upright and personally I totally liked the shot better.  But it is always subjective of course.</td>', 'I think that photographically it''s a sound work, but to me the angle is far too steep and that the hair in the face is a bit too excessive.  I like the B/W tones and the background as well as the fall off...you know i just saved and rotated it more upright and personally I totally liked the shot better.  But it is always subjective of course.', '2004-03-18 12:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(627380, 64577, 6888, '<td valign="top">the light grey border is a distraction...the crop you chose is very nice...gives a good contrast between your model and the background...I really like the way the hair is blowing back across her face...she has amazing eyes...looks very comfortable posing...nice job</td>', 'the light grey border is a distraction...the crop you chose is very nice...gives a good contrast between your model and the background...I really like the way the hair is blowing back across her face...she has amazing eyes...looks very comfortable posing...nice job', '2004-03-18 12:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(627381, 64594, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice shot except that the eys look a bit odd...not sure if its natural or some post processing</td>', 'nice shot except that the eys look a bit odd...not sure if its natural or some post processing', '2004-03-18 12:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(627382, 64393, 6888, '<td valign="top">very nice casual shot...he looks very comfortable posing...the contrast is very good</td>', 'very nice casual shot...he looks very comfortable posing...the contrast is very good', '2004-03-18 12:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(627383, 64653, 6888, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring you used here...a nice simple outdoors shot works well...</td>', 'I like the coloring you used here...a nice simple outdoors shot works well...', '2004-03-18 12:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(627384, 64403, 6888, '<td valign="top">b/w is great on this shot...very emotional shot...nice DOF</td>', 'b/w is great on this shot...very emotional shot...nice DOF', '2004-03-18 12:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(627436, 64592, 13384, '<td valign="top">you know to me if you just had a different background, this is a fantastic shot of her.  Love the color of the her eye''s to her top...but the background color is a clash to me.  Oh and as I look at it more, the hat is a bit flat, seems too evenly lit.  For sure its the right track to a great shot.....</td>', 'you know to me if you just had a different background, this is a fantastic shot of her.  Love the color of the her eye''s to her top...but the background color is a clash to me.  Oh and as I look at it more, the hat is a bit flat, seems too evenly lit.  For sure its the right track to a great shot.....', '2004-03-18 12:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(627474, 64172, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful portrait!  i love the soft, muted colors and the composition.  great lighting and DOF.</td>', 'beautiful portrait!  i love the soft, muted colors and the composition.  great lighting and DOF.', '2004-03-18 13:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(627477, 64561, 1717, '<td valign="top">very cute!  the lighting seems a bit hot on his feet and a bit shadowed on his face, though.  nice composition and pose.</td>', 'very cute!  the lighting seems a bit hot on his feet and a bit shadowed on his face, though.  nice composition and pose.', '2004-03-18 13:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(627483, 64353, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful model and a lovely portrait.</td>', 'beautiful model and a lovely portrait.', '2004-03-18 13:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(627489, 64459, 1717, '<td valign="top">very cute model.  background is a bit distracting and the focus on her eyes isn''t as sharp as i would like to see.</td>', 'very cute model.  background is a bit distracting and the focus on her eyes isn''t as sharp as i would like to see.', '2004-03-18 13:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(627490, 64523, 1717, '<td valign="top">great perspective and i love that color.  good crisp focus.</td>', 'great perspective and i love that color.  good crisp focus.', '2004-03-18 13:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(627491, 64315, 1717, '<td valign="top">great shot!  i love the composition and the b&amp;w tone works really well.  nicely done!</td>', 'great shot!  i love the composition and the b&w tone works really well.  nicely done!', '2004-03-18 13:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(627493, 64479, 1717, '<td valign="top">very cute model and pose.  the focus seems a bit off, though, and the multiple catchlights in his eyes are distracting...tends to make the eyes seem even more out of focus.</td>', 'very cute model and pose.  the focus seems a bit off, though, and the multiple catchlights in his eyes are distracting...tends to make the eyes seem even more out of focus.', '2004-03-18 13:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(627495, 64443, 1717, '<td valign="top">good lighting and shadows...i like the highlights in his hair.</td>', 'good lighting and shadows...i like the highlights in his hair.', '2004-03-18 13:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(627498, 64031, 1717, '<td valign="top">i''m fairly open-minded when it comes to what consists of ''fitting the challenge''...i have to admit, though, i can''t see the connection here.  i supposed it is shot in portrait orientation so you''re not totally off-base.  i just prefer that my portrait subjects at least be breathing. :)</td>', 'i''m fairly open-minded when it comes to what consists of ''fitting the challenge''...i have to admit, though, i can''t see the connection here.  i supposed it is shot in portrait orientation so you''re not totally off-base.  i just prefer that my portrait subjects at least be breathing. :)', '2004-03-18 13:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(627500, 64463, 1717, '<td valign="top">lol...what a hunk!  a very fun photo with great colors and detail.  this one makes me laugh. :)</td>', 'lol...what a hunk!  a very fun photo with great colors and detail.  this one makes me laugh. :)', '2004-03-18 13:55:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(627503, 64401, 1717, '<td valign="top">great composition and nice colors.</td>', 'great composition and nice colors.', '2004-03-18 13:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(627506, 64639, 1717, '<td valign="top">how cute!  i love the post and the sepia tone works really well.  beautiful lighting!</td>', 'how cute!  i love the post and the sepia tone works really well.  beautiful lighting!', '2004-03-18 14:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(627513, 64263, 1717, '<td valign="top">i really like this straightforward shot.  lighting is a bit hot but i think it works fairly well.  i think it might work even better with a lighter colored background for a totally highkey effect.  great highlights in the hair and those eyes!   the only other nitpick i have is the multiple catchlights in the eyes.  this being an advanced editing challenge, it''s the perfect opportunity to fix that with editing.</td>', 'i really like this straightforward shot.  lighting is a bit hot but i think it works fairly well.  i think it might work even better with a lighter colored background for a totally highkey effect.  great highlights in the hair and those eyes!   the only other nitpick i have is the multiple catchlights in the eyes.  this being an advanced editing challenge, it''s the perfect opportunity to fix that with editing.', '2004-03-18 14:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(627536, 64593, 18665, '<td valign="top">Great Model and Great Expression on her face but may be little problem on her face :S mainly on chicks....</td>', 'Great Model and Great Expression on her face but may be little problem on her face :S mainly on chicks....', '2004-03-18 14:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(627579, 63838, 18664, '<td valign="top">The balance of light and dark is excellent, especially since they aren''t in similar patterns-it breaks up the shot cleanly.</td>', 'The balance of light and dark is excellent, especially since they aren''t in similar patterns-it breaks up the shot cleanly.', '2004-03-18 15:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(627581, 64112, 18480, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors, good lighting....this picture really jumped out at me and stood alone!   Great Job!!</td>', 'Very nice colors, good lighting....this picture really jumped out at me and stood alone!   Great Job!!', '2004-03-18 15:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(627632, 64263, 6888, '<td valign="top">such piercing green eyes - real?...nicely posed but a bit overexposed on right side</td>', 'such piercing green eyes - real?...nicely posed but a bit overexposed on right side', '2004-03-18 15:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(627633, 64428, 6888, '<td valign="top">nicely done...really stands out from the vivid white background</td>', 'nicely done...really stands out from the vivid white background', '2004-03-18 15:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
