(627637, 64589, 13384, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, just a tad soft though I am sure that was the intent.  In my taste the pose is not very flattering and a possible detraction.  Pretty good shot . . .</td>', 'Great lighting, just a tad soft though I am sure that was the intent.  In my taste the pose is not very flattering and a possible detraction.  Pretty good shot . . .', '2004-03-18 15:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
