(627999, 64036, 7908, '<td valign="top">Too much of the funky colors and blending for my tastes ... but certainly makes for an interesting, if somewhat odd, portrait.</td>', 'Too much of the funky colors and blending for my tastes ... but certainly makes for an interesting, if somewhat odd, portrait.', '2004-03-18 21:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(628009, 64560, 7908, '<td valign="top">Great! Love the tonal range, the natural pose, and the way the wall softens behind him.</td>', 'Great! Love the tonal range, the natural pose, and the way the wall softens behind him.', '2004-03-18 21:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(628012, 64585, 18588, '<td valign="top">Window light is just great. Nice diagonal division of the plane.</td>', 'Window light is just great. Nice diagonal division of the plane.', '2004-03-18 21:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(628014, 64556, 7908, '<td valign="top">Hey, that''s fun! Really like the color theme, and the silliness of it! Very creative! A little soft around the hand though.</td>', 'Hey, that''s fun! Really like the color theme, and the silliness of it! Very creative! A little soft around the hand though.', '2004-03-18 21:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(628018, 64451, 7908, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done ... I like seeing a portrait in some sort of context. The wrinkles in the background are distracting though.</td>', 'Very nicely done ... I like seeing a portrait in some sort of context. The wrinkles in the background are distracting though.', '2004-03-18 21:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(628021, 64623, 806, '<td valign="top">I like your bravery to make a grainy photograph - shows your artistic side.<br/>I don''t like how I tend to look up the child''s nose. Nice soft eyes.</td>', 'I like your bravery to make a grainy photograph - shows your artistic side.I don''t like how I tend to look up the child''s nose. Nice soft eyes.', '2004-03-18 21:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(628025, 64370, 806, '<td valign="top">isn''t Sam getting big! beautiful little boy, love the toes, the expression. great job getting him to look right at the camera. most people miss that in a portrait.<br/></td>', 'isn''t Sam getting big! beautiful little boy, love the toes, the expression. great job getting him to look right at the camera. most people miss that in a portrait.', '2004-03-18 21:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(628027, 64443, 806, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and background. his eye direction takes away from the overall feel of the shot. same expression looking directly at the camera would have a greater impact.</td>', 'nice lighting and background. his eye direction takes away from the overall feel of the shot. same expression looking directly at the camera would have a greater impact.', '2004-03-18 21:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(628042, 64593, 806, '<td valign="top">nice portrait of Anastasia. :)<br/>I am not sure I like her cheek cut off like that, but I like her eyes and her expression. nice tilt to her head...feels natural.<br/>a bit of a green cast.</td>', 'nice portrait of Anastasia. :)I am not sure I like her cheek cut off like that, but I like her eyes and her expression. nice tilt to her head...feels natural.a bit of a green cast.', '2004-03-18 22:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(628045, 64481, 806, '<td valign="top">what a doll! beautiful "cow" eyes.<br/>the crop needs to eliminate or almost eliminate the brick background. lighting is wonderful! I think this is only missing a good crop.</td>', 'what a doll! beautiful "cow" eyes.the crop needs to eliminate or almost eliminate the brick background. lighting is wonderful! I think this is only missing a good crop.', '2004-03-18 22:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(628046, 64530, 806, '<td valign="top">did you mean for this to be horizontal? I think vertical would be better(forgive me, I don''t want to insult your artistic side). - gorgeous portrait otherwise.</td>', 'did you mean for this to be horizontal? I think vertical would be better(forgive me, I don''t want to insult your artistic side). - gorgeous portrait otherwise.', '2004-03-18 22:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(628048, 64519, 806, '<td valign="top">Los = "the" , or Loss?<br/>Just curious. :)<br/>interesting lighting - increases the mood.</td>', 'Los = "the" , or Loss?Just curious. :)interesting lighting - increases the mood.', '2004-03-18 22:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(628052, 64451, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting portrait putting the person into their "environment". Great lighting. The only 2 things I would tweek would be to 1) change his hand position to face the back of the hand to the camera rather than the side of the hand... back of the hand is more masculine. 2) I might have him lean toward the piano a bit more, or rest the other arm or hand on it. He is getting his portrait taken with the piano, so it must be an important aspect of his life.<br/>nice going all around. :)</td>', 'interesting portrait putting the person into their "environment". Great lighting. The only 2 things I would tweek would be to 1) change his hand position to face the back of the hand to the camera rather than the side of the hand... back of the hand is more masculine. 2) I might have him lean toward the piano a bit more, or rest the other arm or hand on it. He is getting his portrait taken with the piano, so it must be an important aspect of his life.nice going all around. :)', '2004-03-18 22:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(628055, 64490, 806, '<td valign="top">lovely. the background is out of the dof enough to not become part of her, yet gives texture and color. she is a doll, and I love the "free" mood of the whole image.</td>', 'lovely. the background is out of the dof enough to not become part of her, yet gives texture and color. she is a doll, and I love the "free" mood of the whole image.', '2004-03-18 22:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(628058, 64418, 806, '<td valign="top">thanks for the comic relief :P<br/> <br/>interesting, funny - but interesting. :)</td>', 'thanks for the comic relief :P interesting, funny - but interesting. :)', '2004-03-18 22:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(628059, 64529, 6771, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  almost looks like a charcoal drawing.  Still resembles photography to me, but you are gonna get hammered.  I do like the softness of it, especially for a portrait</td>', 'Interesting.  almost looks like a charcoal drawing.  Still resembles photography to me, but you are gonna get hammered.  I do like the softness of it, especially for a portrait', '2004-03-18 22:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(628060, 64172, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  colors are great and lighting is good.  a little more DOF to bring the eyes out (sharper)</td>', 'Nice perspective.  colors are great and lighting is good.  a little more DOF to bring the eyes out (sharper)', '2004-03-18 22:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(628061, 64650, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting (a touch softer would work for me), but highlights the face very well.  I do like you keepig the eyes blue.  the range of grays is great.  a touch more contrast. great job</td>', 'Very nice lighting (a touch softer would work for me), but highlights the face very well.  I do like you keepig the eyes blue.  the range of grays is great.  a touch more contrast. great job', '2004-03-18 22:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(628065, 64607, 6771, '<td valign="top">Looks like early morning or late afternoon lighting here.  a little bright area on the nose.  I think softening this photo up would make her skin alot smoother and "flatter" the subject more.  On close inspection, the right upper corner has painting circles.  Blur those up a bit, so they are not as noticable.</td>', 'Looks like early morning or late afternoon lighting here.  a little bright area on the nose.  I think softening this photo up would make her skin alot smoother and "flatter" the subject more.  On close inspection, the right upper corner has painting circles.  Blur those up a bit, so they are not as noticable.', '2004-03-18 22:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(628066, 64577, 6771, '<td valign="top">This is a great pose.  Sharper on those eyes and then softening up the rest of the face (the nose seems most prominent and focused).  Very good</td>', 'This is a great pose.  Sharper on those eyes and then softening up the rest of the face (the nose seems most prominent and focused).  Very good', '2004-03-18 22:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(628067, 64651, 6771, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject, lighting and focus.  my only gripe is you cut off his head</td>', 'Excellent subject, lighting and focus.  my only gripe is you cut off his head', '2004-03-18 22:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(628068, 64550, 16425, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot, my friend.  I must say- one attractive man ;)</td>', 'wonderful shot, my friend.  I must say- one attractive man ;)', '2004-03-18 22:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(628077, 64527, 15303, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful!</td>', 'absolutely beautiful!', '2004-03-18 22:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(628085, 64036, 16829, '<td valign="top">I love it. A great photograph to begin with, and the artistic rendering is very effective. I wonder if other people are thinking the same.</td>', 'I love it. A great photograph to begin with, and the artistic rendering is very effective. I wonder if other people are thinking the same.', '2004-03-18 22:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(628089, 64167, 18342, '<td valign="top">Her eyes are beautiful, and mysterious.  lovely portrait</td>', 'Her eyes are beautiful, and mysterious.  lovely portrait', '2004-03-18 22:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(628090, 64180, 16829, '<td valign="top">Overall a fine portrait. Maybe less feathers and/or a different arrangement would visually present your subject better.</td>', 'Overall a fine portrait. Maybe less feathers and/or a different arrangement would visually present your subject better.', '2004-03-18 22:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(628095, 64481, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Not a whole lot of expression on the model''s part, but good color and DOF. Brick background was a good choice- almost matches the eyes. The highlights on the face are a little blown out- diffusing the light a bit might have helped there, but well done overall! 8</td>', 'Great shot. Not a whole lot of expression on the model''s part, but good color and DOF. Brick background was a good choice- almost matches the eyes. The highlights on the face are a little blown out- diffusing the light a bit might have helped there, but well done overall! 8', '2004-03-18 22:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(628100, 64204, 17203, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and a nice change of pace. Could have worked for Parallel Lines, too. The tip of the shoe is out of focus- a higher f-stop (if possible) would have solved that unless you were simply too close to focus. The blurry North Face type is quite distracting.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and a nice change of pace. Could have worked for Parallel Lines, too. The tip of the shoe is out of focus- a higher f-stop (if possible) would have solved that unless you were simply too close to focus. The blurry North Face type is quite distracting.', '2004-03-18 22:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(628102, 64593, 16829, '<td valign="top">A good likeness, but the straight on expression just doesn''t project any personality, especially with such a tight crop. The shoulder is way too strong a foreground object.</td>', 'A good likeness, but the straight on expression just doesn''t project any personality, especially with such a tight crop. The shoulder is way too strong a foreground object.', '2004-03-18 22:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(628104, 64618, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good pose and lighting. Very nice overall. A little overboard on the color and smooth face, though- looks almost surreal. I would have cloned out that green seal on the shirt, too.</td>', 'Good pose and lighting. Very nice overall. A little overboard on the color and smooth face, though- looks almost surreal. I would have cloned out that green seal on the shirt, too.', '2004-03-18 23:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(628107, 64566, 17203, '<td valign="top">Too funny! I can''t tell if he''s upset or pondering a physics equation. ;-D The composition looks better to me if I crop out the shoes and some of the left side.</td>', 'Too funny! I can''t tell if he''s upset or pondering a physics equation. ;-D The composition looks better to me if I crop out the shoes and some of the left side.', '2004-03-18 23:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(628129, 64119, 17203, '<td valign="top">There is no way this doesn''t walk away with a ribbon. The diagonal straw coming from his eye is distracting, but the light quality is phenomenal. Great shot!</td>', 'There is no way this doesn''t walk away with a ribbon. The diagonal straw coming from his eye is distracting, but the light quality is phenomenal. Great shot!', '2004-03-18 23:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(628144, 64577, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. Great expression and color- nicely done. Minor nitpicks... the blown-out collar, soft focus on the hand and the red spot by the nose that could have easily been fixed. Still great. 9</td>', 'One of my favorites. Great expression and color- nicely done. Minor nitpicks... the blown-out collar, soft focus on the hand and the red spot by the nose that could have easily been fixed. Still great. 9', '2004-03-18 23:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(628154, 64459, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great expression, lighting and POV. The background picture is distracting- looks better to me if I simply crop  the left side just enough to lose the frame. The color is a little overdone (particularly the red). That said, this is still one of my favorites. Should be in the top 20 easily.</td>', 'Great expression, lighting and POV. The background picture is distracting- looks better to me if I simply crop  the left side just enough to lose the frame. The color is a little overdone (particularly the red). That said, this is still one of my favorites. Should be in the top 20 easily.', '2004-03-18 23:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(628168, 64527, 17203, '<td valign="top">My second favorite. The fabric color and eyes are very striking. The only thing I can suggest is a slightly more diffuse light more to the side (the right side of the face is a little hot), and focus looks a bit soft on the fabric above her eyes. Still, this is definitely ribbon-worthy. 9</td>', 'My second favorite. The fabric color and eyes are very striking. The only thing I can suggest is a slightly more diffuse light more to the side (the right side of the face is a little hot), and focus looks a bit soft on the fabric above her eyes. Still, this is definitely ribbon-worthy. 9', '2004-03-18 23:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(628190, 64180, 1712, '<td valign="top">This is just adoreable!,Her mother must be too.</td>', 'This is just adoreable!,Her mother must be too.', '2004-03-19 00:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(628193, 64280, 17547, '<td valign="top">Had to change my vote on this when I came back to it, great color, really says something to me. Good job. 8</td>', 'Had to change my vote on this when I came back to it, great color, really says something to me. Good job. 8', '2004-03-19 00:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(628196, 64490, 17547, '<td valign="top">Great shot, might of crop the left side a little more or centered the model more, but over all well done. This should do well I would think.</td>', 'Great shot, might of crop the left side a little more or centered the model more, but over all well done. This should do well I would think.', '2004-03-19 00:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(628202, 64119, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of natural light. Only a sunset can be that warm. Anyway... it is one of the best. 10 from me.</td>', 'Excellent use of natural light. Only a sunset can be that warm. Anyway... it is one of the best. 10 from me.', '2004-03-19 00:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(628207, 64481, 12902, '<td valign="top">Congratulations for the little model. She is a princess. The photo is excellent too. 10 from me.</td>', 'Congratulations for the little model. She is a princess. The photo is excellent too. 10 from me.', '2004-03-19 00:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(628217, 64376, 12902, '<td valign="top">Perfect portrait of a perfect little girl. 10</td>', 'Perfect portrait of a perfect little girl. 10', '2004-03-19 00:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(628261, 64036, 5728, '<td valign="top">I don''t know it you''ve used a filter on this or created the effect through the lighting set up. Either way the combination is awesome and it works for me (9).</td>', 'I don''t know it you''ve used a filter on this or created the effect through the lighting set up. Either way the combination is awesome and it works for me (9).', '2004-03-19 02:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
