(629153, 64181, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is very well done. I love the sepia feel and the whole old fashion look. It reminds me of old photos of my grandfather. The man in your photo looks very warm hearted. It shows through his eyes and smile. Good correction of glass glare. You''ve done well. I wish you best of luck with this.</td>', 'This is very well done. I love the sepia feel and the whole old fashion look. It reminds me of old photos of my grandfather. The man in your photo looks very warm hearted. It shows through his eyes and smile. Good correction of glass glare. You''ve done well. I wish you best of luck with this.', '2004-03-19 21:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(629157, 64505, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is just precious. What a gorgeous little baby. The expression in his face is just priceless. The reflection in the metal object on the right adds nice little touch. Simple beautiful photo.</td>', 'This is just precious. What a gorgeous little baby. The expression in his face is just priceless. The reflection in the metal object on the right adds nice little touch. Simple beautiful photo.', '2004-03-19 21:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(629161, 64528, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Extra points for that. Love the subdued colours. My only suggestion would have been to make the part where her eyes reflect in the mirror clear, so the eyes would come through sharp. That way the viewer could focus on that point. Ofcourse if you intended overall soft feel, then job well done.</td>', 'Very creative. Extra points for that. Love the subdued colours. My only suggestion would have been to make the part where her eyes reflect in the mirror clear, so the eyes would come through sharp. That way the viewer could focus on that point. Ofcourse if you intended overall soft feel, then job well done.', '2004-03-19 21:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(629165, 64180, 10275, '<td valign="top">Oh, she is quite a little lady. What a beautiful composition. Great lines. Natural pose, good loking skin, great sharpness yet soft feeling. Way to go Sonja. Good bless her little soul.</td>', 'Oh, she is quite a little lady. What a beautiful composition. Great lines. Natural pose, good loking skin, great sharpness yet soft feeling. Way to go Sonja. Good bless her little soul.', '2004-03-19 21:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
