(629773, 64527, 6388, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.  Looks like natural sunlight too (windows reflected in her eyes).  :)<br/>Since this was a n open challenge I might have used Photoshop to soften those reflections, but that''s just me.  beautiful photo.  Nice rich colours and natural skin tones.  The crop shows just enough material to balance her face. Very well done.<br/>Pedro</td>', 'Fabulous.  Looks like natural sunlight too (windows reflected in her eyes).  :)Since this was a n open challenge I might have used Photoshop to soften those reflections, but that''s just me.  beautiful photo.  Nice rich colours and natural skin tones.  The crop shows just enough material to balance her face. Very well done.Pedro', '2004-03-20 23:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(629775, 64204, 6388, '<td valign="top">Nice. Didn''t notice the soles of the shoes the first time.  Too bad the hat blurred (looks like a North Face hat?)  Love the high key approach to this; doesn''t always work on people pix, but great here.  I might have included a little more of the window frame at the bottom, but very cool nonetheless.<br/>Pedro</td>', 'Nice. Didn''t notice the soles of the shoes the first time.  Too bad the hat blurred (looks like a North Face hat?)  Love the high key approach to this; doesn''t always work on people pix, but great here.  I might have included a little more of the window frame at the bottom, but very cool nonetheless.Pedro', '2004-03-20 23:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(629776, 64612, 6388, '<td valign="top">Did she know you were taking this?  If not you were very stealthy, and pretty impressive in your ability to grab this at the right moment.  There''s lots of contrast, and i like that.  One of my favourites in the challenge.<br/>Pedro</td>', 'Did she know you were taking this?  If not you were very stealthy, and pretty impressive in your ability to grab this at the right moment.  There''s lots of contrast, and i like that.  One of my favourites in the challenge.Pedro', '2004-03-20 23:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(629778, 64639, 6388, '<td valign="top">High Key and very cool.  Can''t tell if he''s posing or really not impressed :)<br/>A framer for sure. Some people may not like the high contrast, but i think it fits.  I might burn a little around his shoulders (or put him in something slightly off-white next time) so they don''t completely disappear into the backdrop, but that''s being pretty picky.  I keep coming back to this one. - very nice.<br/>Pedro</td>', 'High Key and very cool.  Can''t tell if he''s posing or really not impressed :)A framer for sure. Some people may not like the high contrast, but i think it fits.  I might burn a little around his shoulders (or put him in something slightly off-white next time) so they don''t completely disappear into the backdrop, but that''s being pretty picky.  I keep coming back to this one. - very nice.Pedro', '2004-03-20 23:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
