(629907, 64036, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love this...the colors are wonderful.  i''m anxious to see how you achieved this since i''m assuming your model didn''t wear multi-colored make-up and this was done with post processing.  the soft focus blends everything well and gives the image an iridescent quality.  nice work!</td>', 'i love this...the colors are wonderful.  i''m anxious to see how you achieved this since i''m assuming your model didn''t wear multi-colored make-up and this was done with post processing.  the soft focus blends everything well and gives the image an iridescent quality.  nice work!', '2004-03-21 01:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
