(629934, 64167, 16670, '<td valign="top">very well done!</td>', 'very well done!', '2004-03-21 02:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(629935, 64172, 16670, '<td valign="top">Eyeglasses cutting the eyes doesn''t do it for me!</td>', 'Eyeglasses cutting the eyes doesn''t do it for me!', '2004-03-21 02:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(629936, 64376, 16670, '<td valign="top">Looks like empty eye sockets..otherwise...</td>', 'Looks like empty eye sockets..otherwise...', '2004-03-21 02:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(629937, 64462, 16670, '<td valign="top">yes, a good character study.</td>', 'yes, a good character study.', '2004-03-21 02:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(629938, 64632, 16670, '<td valign="top">Do they really smile like this?</td>', 'Do they really smile like this?', '2004-03-21 02:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(629939, 64561, 16670, '<td valign="top">Oh, yes!  I like it!</td>', 'Oh, yes!  I like it!', '2004-03-21 02:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(629945, 64181, 4008, '<td valign="top">such a formal headshot really fits well with the importance of the man in uniform. Could have done with a bigger distance to the background to get it out of focus.</td>', 'such a formal headshot really fits well with the importance of the man in uniform. Could have done with a bigger distance to the background to get it out of focus.', '2004-03-21 05:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(629948, 64500, 4008, '<td valign="top">I would crop of part of the left, up to her armpit, leave the arms but remove the rest of the body, so you get a nice play of diagonals around the face. Great shot.</td>', 'I would crop of part of the left, up to her armpit, leave the arms but remove the rest of the body, so you get a nice play of diagonals around the face. Great shot.', '2004-03-21 05:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(629949, 64353, 18512, '<td valign="top">Lovely skin-tones and exciting cropping. Good composition.<br/>Well done!</td>', 'Lovely skin-tones and exciting cropping. Good composition.Well done!', '2004-03-21 05:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(629952, 64367, 18512, '<td valign="top">Strange, but good. Maybe too hard contrast at left. Nice composition.</td>', 'Strange, but good. Maybe too hard contrast at left. Nice composition.', '2004-03-21 05:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(629954, 64268, 18512, '<td valign="top">I love this picture! Light stripes are an usual effect in model photographing, - but the way the are brought into the child''s face here, is rather brilliant. An exciting and well done portrait. Congratulations!</td>', 'I love this picture! Light stripes are an usual effect in model photographing, - but the way the are brought into the child''s face here, is rather brilliant. An exciting and well done portrait. Congratulations!', '2004-03-21 05:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(629977, 64589, 6100, '<td valign="top">This is a VERY good recreation of Vermeer''s classic including the angle of the body, the costume, the lighting on the face, etc. If you every try this again, I would have the blue wrap cover less of the ear as in the painting and maybe lower the camera slightly and have the subject look over her shoulder just a bit more. I enjoyed studying this one!</td>', 'This is a VERY good recreation of Vermeer''s classic including the angle of the body, the costume, the lighting on the face, etc. If you every try this again, I would have the blue wrap cover less of the ear as in the painting and maybe lower the camera slightly and have the subject look over her shoulder just a bit more. I enjoyed studying this one!', '2004-03-21 07:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(629981, 64527, 6100, '<td valign="top">I only see two very slight flaws in this excellent portrait. First is the second catchlight in your subject''s right eye and second is that the tip of her nose is slightly out of focus. Her eyes are captivating; you''ve done a marvelous job of lighting. 10.</td>', 'I only see two very slight flaws in this excellent portrait. First is the second catchlight in your subject''s right eye and second is that the tip of her nose is slightly out of focus. Her eyes are captivating; you''ve done a marvelous job of lighting. 10.', '2004-03-21 07:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(629983, 64451, 6100, '<td valign="top">Execellent composition and posing. I would tone down the highlighted button and the specular hightlight on the piano. I like how the hair light adds separation between the subject and background.</td>', 'Execellent composition and posing. I would tone down the highlighted button and the specular hightlight on the piano. I like how the hair light adds separation between the subject and background.', '2004-03-21 07:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(629991, 64181, 6100, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I would try to get the subject a bit further away from the background so that the wrinkles in the BG don''t show. You''ve done a very good job of eliminating any reflections in the eyeglasses while retaining catchlights in the eyes and  you''ve portrayed a man obviously proud of what he is and proud to serve his public! Very powerful image.</td>', 'Excellent! I would try to get the subject a bit further away from the background so that the wrinkles in the BG don''t show. You''ve done a very good job of eliminating any reflections in the eyeglasses while retaining catchlights in the eyes and  you''ve portrayed a man obviously proud of what he is and proud to serve his public! Very powerful image.', '2004-03-21 07:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(629996, 64459, 6100, '<td valign="top">I like the catchlights in the eyes. They bring a real sparkle to this young lady''s face. I also like the Degas you''ve used in the background. That adds a special dimension to your portrait.</td>', 'I like the catchlights in the eyes. They bring a real sparkle to this young lady''s face. I also like the Degas you''ve used in the background. That adds a special dimension to your portrait.', '2004-03-21 07:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(630002, 64167, 4380, '<td valign="top">nice perspective/angle, very good colour toning and composition, and most all beautifu model...congrats</td>', 'nice perspective/angle, very good colour toning and composition, and most all beautifu model...congrats', '2004-03-21 07:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(630005, 63931, 4380, '<td valign="top">the angle is excllent, nice mood, lighting is just fine, great focus i just found a very little flaws here, theres a glare in the glasses, but its okay for me, you can correct that later in photoediting software. EXCELLENT WORK.</td>', 'the angle is excllent, nice mood, lighting is just fine, great focus i just found a very little flaws here, theres a glare in the glasses, but its okay for me, you can correct that later in photoediting software. EXCELLENT WORK.', '2004-03-21 07:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(630008, 64519, 4380, '<td valign="top">another excellent submission...good posing/angle/perspective, very good lighting too, excellent cropping...very dramatic...great work</td>', 'another excellent submission...good posing/angle/perspective, very good lighting too, excellent cropping...very dramatic...great work', '2004-03-21 07:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(630009, 64564, 4380, '<td valign="top">very candid, great shot. nice lighting and i do like the expressions. nice eyes too. great work</td>', 'very candid, great shot. nice lighting and i do like the expressions. nice eyes too. great work', '2004-03-21 07:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(630011, 64438, 4380, '<td valign="top">excellent perspective, good choice of black and white, fine composition and lighting</td>', 'excellent perspective, good choice of black and white, fine composition and lighting', '2004-03-21 07:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(630012, 64268, 4380, '<td valign="top">cliche...but still excellent image, its good you choice black and white medium here, it really works great here, nice expression, what a powerful look, i do like the shadows, lines and patterns,  EXCELLENT WORK AND GOOD LUCK.. YOU DESERVE A RIBBON HERE.</td>', 'cliche...but still excellent image, its good you choice black and white medium here, it really works great here, nice expression, what a powerful look, i do like the shadows, lines and patterns,  EXCELLENT WORK AND GOOD LUCK.. YOU DESERVE A RIBBON HERE.', '2004-03-21 07:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(630015, 64623, 4380, '<td valign="top">NICE image, great posing and expression, the composition is very good, grainy effect here is perfectly works. a very powerful image and you really deserved a ribbon   here. Good luck to this submission</td>', 'NICE image, great posing and expression, the composition is very good, grainy effect here is perfectly works. a very powerful image and you really deserved a ribbon   here. Good luck to this submission', '2004-03-21 07:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(630017, 64204, 4380, '<td valign="top">one a kind, perfect perspective, very creative. the lighting is fine, the framing is very effective. excellent image...ITS OUT FROM THE ORDINARY IMAGES! EXCELLENT IMAGE! GOOD LUCK</td>', 'one a kind, perfect perspective, very creative. the lighting is fine, the framing is very effective. excellent image...ITS OUT FROM THE ORDINARY IMAGES! EXCELLENT IMAGE! GOOD LUCK', '2004-03-21 07:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
