(630085, 64451, 10883, '<td valign="top">Hi!<br/> <br/>You seem to have nailed all the technical details of this pic down!  The framing, composition, lighting and exposure all are very good.  But the pose of the model strikes as forced and/or unnatural.  It just seems a bit cliche (spelling).</td>', 'Hi! You seem to have nailed all the technical details of this pic down!  The framing, composition, lighting and exposure all are very good.  But the pose of the model strikes as forced and/or unnatural.  It just seems a bit cliche (spelling).', '2004-03-21 09:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(630103, 64557, 18485, '<td valign="top">lovely detail, excellent lighting but a little too tightly cropped for full marks.</td>', 'lovely detail, excellent lighting but a little too tightly cropped for full marks.', '2004-03-21 09:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(630105, 64633, 7889, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo but the challenge is specific in stating a person''s face. It will be in my favs when the challenge is over.</td>', 'This is an excellent photo but the challenge is specific in stating a person''s face. It will be in my favs when the challenge is over.', '2004-03-21 09:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(630106, 64557, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good effort, i see hope more than passion in this shot. Good luck</td>', 'Good effort, i see hope more than passion in this shot. Good luck', '2004-03-21 09:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(630108, 64577, 5728, '<td valign="top">The hair blowing across her face is what does it for this photo. I get the sense of movement by it and at the same time her eyes are looking at me in a frozen stare. Good composition, the negative space on the right in the direction of the wind blowing is a good touch. I also like the way the thumb is pointing in that direction. I personally would have done a little extra photoshop work on the eyes, a slight bit sharper and also I would have dodged the whites of the eyes to make them a tiny bit lighter.</td>', 'The hair blowing across her face is what does it for this photo. I get the sense of movement by it and at the same time her eyes are looking at me in a frozen stare. Good composition, the negative space on the right in the direction of the wind blowing is a good touch. I also like the way the thumb is pointing in that direction. I personally would have done a little extra photoshop work on the eyes, a slight bit sharper and also I would have dodged the whites of the eyes to make them a tiny bit lighter.', '2004-03-21 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(630111, 64563, 7889, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo but the background spoils this. great DOF would have made a lot of difference.</td>', 'Lovely photo but the background spoils this. great DOF would have made a lot of difference.', '2004-03-21 09:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(630113, 64494, 7889, '<td valign="top">Too small for this to have any impact</td>', 'Too small for this to have any impact', '2004-03-21 09:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
