(630273, 64530, 14620, '<td valign="top">I really like the black and white treatment and the focus is very nice.  Maybe a little less hair covering the face, which is quite appealing.  Would like to see more of it. :)  But overall a very nice shot.</td>', 'I really like the black and white treatment and the focus is very nice.  Maybe a little less hair covering the face, which is quite appealing.  Would like to see more of it. :)  But overall a very nice shot.', '2004-03-21 15:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
