(630413, 64560, 772, '<td valign="top">Very moody... this image creates a story in my mind to go along with the subject... great introspective portrait.. = 10</td>', 'Very moody... this image creates a story in my mind to go along with the subject... great introspective portrait.. = 10', '2004-03-21 18:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
