(630707, 64543, 7706, '<td valign="top">Yay you (and yay maggie lol) Its good to see another photo in your top scores.<br/> <br/>*looks at time. Oh shit I am still within first 5 minutes of this challenge ending. Will I get the ''predictable'' speach again?* lol Oh well I am not the first this time lol<br/> <br/>And by the way on the photo, I just read the comments on this photo. I have to say that I agree with your choise to make the eyes stand out like that, despite a lot of people disagreeing with it. The eyes are teh key to the sole, plus they are also the first thing you will ever look at in a photo on a person, so its only right that they be a main focal point.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-22 00:17:40.</i></td>', 'Yay you (and yay maggie lol) Its good to see another photo in your top scores. *looks at time. Oh shit I am still within first 5 minutes of this challenge ending. Will I get the ''predictable'' speach again?* lol Oh well I am not the first this time lol And by the way on the photo, I just read the comments on this photo. I have to say that I agree with your choise to make the eyes stand out like that, despite a lot of people disagreeing with it. The eyes are teh key to the sole, plus they are also the first thing you will ever look at in a photo on a person, so its only right that they be a main focal point.', '2004-03-22 00:08:31.000000', '2004-03-22 00:17:40.000000', 0),
