(630806, 64036, 13602, '<td valign="top">Thank you all, I do feel like a winner because of your comments. I guess it''s a bit different and that scares some people. That''s ok, in my opinion a good shot must be really loved or really hated. Because many of you asked, I will post a thread in the forums about how I did it, probably many of you will be surprised of how little and simple editing this suffered. Without a bit of spot editing I did for the mouth and eyes, it would be good for basic editing too, only curves and a bit of gaussian blur. Only took me like 15 minutes. I will post all these in the forums later today, again thanks alot for all your comments weather you like it or hate it.</td>', 'Thank you all, I do feel like a winner because of your comments. I guess it''s a bit different and that scares some people. That''s ok, in my opinion a good shot must be really loved or really hated. Because many of you asked, I will post a thread in the forums about how I did it, probably many of you will be surprised of how little and simple editing this suffered. Without a bit of spot editing I did for the mouth and eyes, it would be good for basic editing too, only curves and a bit of gaussian blur. Only took me like 15 minutes. I will post all these in the forums later today, again thanks alot for all your comments weather you like it or hate it.', '2004-03-22 00:44:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(630807, 64577, 18505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait - thank you for sharing.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait - thank you for sharing.', '2004-03-22 00:44:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(630811, 64031, 10170, '<td valign="top">Not at all surprised this came last, sorry.<br/> <br/>I assume the humour here is meant to be that it is not a portrait, it''s a "mug shot"  ... but it really did mean it missed the point of the challenge,  Shame, nice photo for the right challenge.</td>', 'Not at all surprised this came last, sorry. I assume the humour here is meant to be that it is not a portrait, it''s a "mug shot"  ... but it really did mean it missed the point of the challenge,  Shame, nice photo for the right challenge.', '2004-03-22 00:45:47.000000', NULL, 0),
