(630953, 64577, 14603, '<td valign="top">So pleased to see your work get the recognition it deserves.<br/>Well done.<br/> <br/>Gordon</td>', 'So pleased to see your work get the recognition it deserves.Well done. Gordon', '2004-03-22 03:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(630954, 64527, 5728, '<td valign="top">Woohoooo! My highest score eva, kewl..... Thanx for all your comments and votes. I am very happy about this photo, it is one of my best photos so far and it turned out exactly the way I wanted it. One thing I learnt in this challenge was how subjective portrait photography can be. So many contradicting comments this time, wow! I tried so much on this photo, different crops etc, but this is the way I liked it best of all. The catch lights in her eyes are that big on purpose, exactly how I wanted it. I used a larger soft box to give the impression that it is a reflection of a window, and to lose the feeling of this being a studio shot. Thanx again, it''s good to be back :)</td>', 'Woohoooo! My highest score eva, kewl..... Thanx for all your comments and votes. I am very happy about this photo, it is one of my best photos so far and it turned out exactly the way I wanted it. One thing I learnt in this challenge was how subjective portrait photography can be. So many contradicting comments this time, wow! I tried so much on this photo, different crops etc, but this is the way I liked it best of all. The catch lights in her eyes are that big on purpose, exactly how I wanted it. I used a larger soft box to give the impression that it is a reflection of a window, and to lose the feeling of this being a studio shot. Thanx again, it''s good to be back :)', '2004-03-22 03:47:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(630965, 64577, 10437, '<td valign="top">Yes, she hypnotised me also and got a 10<br/>Well deserved, congratulations!</td>', 'Yes, she hypnotised me also and got a 10Well deserved, congratulations!', '2004-03-22 04:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
