(630979, 64527, 3942, '<td valign="top">Congratulations kiwi, a highly impressive and technically perfect portrait! Wow, a score above 8 - you are going to wake up my ambition :-). <br/>Apart from her eyes, did you use any kind of make-up here? Her skin looks so clear and perfect...</td>', 'Congratulations kiwi, a highly impressive and technically perfect portrait! Wow, a score above 8 - you are going to wake up my ambition :-). Apart from her eyes, did you use any kind of make-up here? Her skin looks so clear and perfect...', '2004-03-22 04:37:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(630981, 64577, 14386, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I "made" it to the top three this time. After 3 fourth place finish, I though the ribbon will continually elude me. I am very overwhelmed with the results and I knew the competition was so stiff after looking at the other entries.<br/> <br/>Anyway, this picture of my student in my Psychology class last semester is a stroke of luck. Trying out my new D70, I came across Kittie on the hallway and I asked her to pose for me (and enter her picture in a competition if it turns out well). She relented. The background is the white wall of our school.<br/> <br/>And by the way, Kittie is on the cover of a Thai magazine this week. She is a part-time ramp and print ad model.<br/> <br/>THANK YOU EVERYONE for giving me my first ribbon! And to the one who gave me a 1, I actually like it as it reminds me of how much I have to learn yet in the field of photography.</td>', 'I can''t believe I "made" it to the top three this time. After 3 fourth place finish, I though the ribbon will continually elude me. I am very overwhelmed with the results and I knew the competition was so stiff after looking at the other entries. Anyway, this picture of my student in my Psychology class last semester is a stroke of luck. Trying out my new D70, I came across Kittie on the hallway and I asked her to pose for me (and enter her picture in a competition if it turns out well). She relented. The background is the white wall of our school. And by the way, Kittie is on the cover of a Thai magazine this week. She is a part-time ramp and print ad model. THANK YOU EVERYONE for giving me my first ribbon! And to the one who gave me a 1, I actually like it as it reminds me of how much I have to learn yet in the field of photography.', '2004-03-22 04:44:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(630993, 64527, 10858, '<td valign="top">Gary, congrats on another well deserved win and a wonderful portrait. And, yeah, your highest score ever, woohooo! :-)</td>', 'Gary, congrats on another well deserved win and a wonderful portrait. And, yeah, your highest score ever, woohooo! :-)', '2004-03-22 05:10:18.000000', NULL, 0),
