(631631, 64505, 14620, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who commented!  It''s both helpful and encouraging to me.  I know it''s not a traditional portrait (being in a bathtub and all) but I think it turned out quite nice.  Of course, I''m probably a little biased... :) And BTW, he really enjoys his baths. :)<br/> <br/>Here was my other choice (and believe me, it was a hard one) but the one I submitted just seemed technically better.  This one was just fun!!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=65990" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/14620/thumb/65990.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/14620/thumb/65990.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/14620/thumb/65990.jpg"/></a> <br/>Thanks again,<br/>Jen<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-22 11:53:37.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all who commented!  It''s both helpful and encouraging to me.  I know it''s not a traditional portrait (being in a bathtub and all) but I think it turned out quite nice.  Of course, I''m probably a little biased... :) And BTW, he really enjoys his baths. :) Here was my other choice (and believe me, it was a hard one) but the one I submitted just seemed technically better.  This one was just fun!!  Thanks again,Jen', '2004-03-22 11:52:35.000000', '2004-03-22 11:53:37.000000', 0),
