(631889, 64639, 18485, '<td valign="top">this really is a great portrait and i gave it a 9.  i really wonder whether there is a bias toward female subjects in these challenges.  cool kid, wonderful treatment.</td>', 'this really is a great portrait and i gave it a 9.  i really wonder whether there is a bias toward female subjects in these challenges.  cool kid, wonderful treatment.', '2004-03-22 15:03:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(631999, 64441, 12268, '<td valign="top">Thanks General! I think it did okay considering how many people thought it needed more light. I wish I could find out how many of thise comments are from epople not calibrating their monitors. I have to edit my shots with it super dark so as not to keep getting these comments but I still need to wrk that out.<br/> <br/>All in all, it wasn;t too bad. :)<br/>Thanks everyone who dropped a comment!</td>', 'Thanks General! I think it did okay considering how many people thought it needed more light. I wish I could find out how many of thise comments are from epople not calibrating their monitors. I have to edit my shots with it super dark so as not to keep getting these comments but I still need to wrk that out. All in all, it wasn;t too bad. :)Thanks everyone who dropped a comment!', '2004-03-22 15:38:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(632150, 64370, 2223, '<td valign="top">6 months already!!! Where does the time go? He''s a real cutie.</td>', '6 months already!!! Where does the time go? He''s a real cutie.', '2004-03-22 16:55:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(632172, 63906, 7889, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. I took this just as I was passing and Pam was reading and ''one'' was not amused! It was an ''off the cuff'' shot, no preperation, no posing, just pointed and bang!Just the one shot, So no time for any fancy soft lighting etc. It just sums up that look I somethimes get which tells me to back off!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-22 17:21:39.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comments. I took this just as I was passing and Pam was reading and ''one'' was not amused! It was an ''off the cuff'' shot, no preperation, no posing, just pointed and bang!Just the one shot, So no time for any fancy soft lighting etc. It just sums up that look I somethimes get which tells me to back off!!', '2004-03-22 17:17:03.000000', '2004-03-22 17:21:39.000000', 0),
(632228, 64180, 5112, '<td valign="top">This one is still my favourite of the challenge - you do just wonderful work with portraiture.</td>', 'This one is still my favourite of the challenge - you do just wonderful work with portraiture.', '2004-03-22 17:55:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(632239, 64577, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great shot Manuel - you have a great talent.</td>', 'Great shot Manuel - you have a great talent.', '2004-03-22 18:04:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(632247, 64618, 18485, '<td valign="top">i am surprised this didn''t do better.  i find whatever neatening you did to enhance the photo and increase the artistic content.  (it''s odd to me that you get dinged for "effect" while the girl with the pearl earring shot is praised for same.  no accounting for it!)</td>', 'i am surprised this didn''t do better.  i find whatever neatening you did to enhance the photo and increase the artistic content.  (it''s odd to me that you get dinged for "effect" while the girl with the pearl earring shot is praised for same.  no accounting for it!)', '2004-03-22 18:06:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(632375, 64612, 9889, '<td valign="top">maybe not a portrait but a great picture.</td>', 'maybe not a portrait but a great picture.', '2004-03-22 19:15:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(632426, 64527, 14386, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful portrait shot! You well-deserved the TOP slot (very comfortably). I also LOVE all your pictures.<br/> <br/>Steve McCurry is also my all time favorite phoyographer.</td>', 'This is a very powerful portrait shot! You well-deserved the TOP slot (very comfortably). I also LOVE all your pictures. Steve McCurry is also my all time favorite phoyographer.', '2004-03-22 19:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(632486, 64527, 11843, '<td valign="top">Perfect as usual Kiwiness!<br/>Stunning capture of a B.E.A.Utiful set of eyes, not to mention model.<br/> <br/>BTW - Thanks for the comment. Were you right? You knew who it was? I didn''t have a willing model.<br/> <br/>Cheers....Martin</td>', 'Perfect as usual Kiwiness!Stunning capture of a B.E.A.Utiful set of eyes, not to mention model. BTW - Thanks for the comment. Were you right? You knew who it was? I didn''t have a willing model. Cheers....Martin', '2004-03-22 20:17:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(632511, 64543, 6900, '<td valign="top">No, I understand.  And I definitely thank you for the thoughtful and long comment.  I do definitely appreciate those.  I guess...when I make a choice in a photo, I''ve definitely done so for a reason.  I didn''t submit for about 3 months because I got kinda aggravated by making choices others didn''t like.  I am more focused on learning how to take a good picture rather than the likes and dislikes of my audience.  I want an editor for that. ;)  But thanks again, really.  I do appreciate the effort.<br/> <br/>M</td>', 'No, I understand.  And I definitely thank you for the thoughtful and long comment.  I do definitely appreciate those.  I guess...when I make a choice in a photo, I''ve definitely done so for a reason.  I didn''t submit for about 3 months because I got kinda aggravated by making choices others didn''t like.  I am more focused on learning how to take a good picture rather than the likes and dislikes of my audience.  I want an editor for that. ;)  But thanks again, really.  I do appreciate the effort. M', '2004-03-22 20:56:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(632546, 64577, 14773, '<td valign="top">the movement in the hair is what sets this apart from most studio shots on DPC..very nice.</td>', 'the movement in the hair is what sets this apart from most studio shots on DPC..very nice.', '2004-03-22 21:53:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(632652, 64606, 4494, '<td valign="top">I agree, Renee, I thought this was a great shot also.  Look at the 12 people who gave it a 1!!  I''d like to hear why they think it deserves a 1.  Extreme voting I guess. :)</td>', 'I agree, Renee, I thought this was a great shot also.  Look at the 12 people who gave it a 1!!  I''d like to hear why they think it deserves a 1.  Extreme voting I guess. :)', '2004-03-22 23:20:54.000000', NULL, 0);
