(633821, 64500, 18403, '<td valign="top">I can clearly see this is a work of passion!<br/>Your Veronique is indeed a lovely subject.  The subtle and selective<br/>sharpening of the image makes a dramatic enhancement of facial features<br/>while softening the background. The sepia-like coloration is perfect.<br/>Well done!</td>', 'I can clearly see this is a work of passion!Your Veronique is indeed a lovely subject.  The subtle and selectivesharpening of the image makes a dramatic enhancement of facial featureswhile softening the background. The sepia-like coloration is perfect.Well done!', '2004-03-23 17:20:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(633828, 64527, 18403, '<td valign="top">I am simply amazed!  The artistry of this image is extraordinary!<br/>Quality is always a winner.<br/></td>', 'I am simply amazed!  The artistry of this image is extraordinary!Quality is always a winner.', '2004-03-23 17:30:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(633835, 64527, 17851, '<td valign="top">I knew you where going to get a ribbon! congrats</td>', 'I knew you where going to get a ribbon! congrats', '2004-03-23 17:41:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(633854, 64527, 17851, '<td valign="top">BTW...i think 12 people that rated this photo are crazy! a 1, 2, 3 ,4 , or even 5''s????<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-23 18:01:29.</i></td>', 'BTW...i think 12 people that rated this photo are crazy! a 1, 2, 3 ,4 , or even 5''s????', '2004-03-23 18:01:08.000000', '2004-03-23 18:01:29.000000', 0),
