(639363, 64459, 16672, '<td valign="top">Poor you Vtruan you didn''t even see the beauty you held at the desivement moment of clicking your shutter. Its a shame to because you could have has a real tried and true beauty. Look at the painting in the back ground the way your daughters hair and face is done up and being of a soft nature flow beautifully with the painting but you cut off the girls head in the portrait. No vtruan your mistake is not to realize the beauty of that poster and have used it to your advantage. I am sorry most of these people know shit about the back ground here its so beautiful and would have completed your image if you had cropped it right by placing the head inside and maybe moving over just enough to see more of it contrasting with your daughters soft characters but hey next time you''ll see it maybe. Thank you for the image.</td>', 'Poor you Vtruan you didn''t even see the beauty you held at the desivement moment of clicking your shutter. Its a shame to because you could have has a real tried and true beauty. Look at the painting in the back ground the way your daughters hair and face is done up and being of a soft nature flow beautifully with the painting but you cut off the girls head in the portrait. No vtruan your mistake is not to realize the beauty of that poster and have used it to your advantage. I am sorry most of these people know shit about the back ground here its so beautiful and would have completed your image if you had cropped it right by placing the head inside and maybe moving over just enough to see more of it contrasting with your daughters soft characters but hey next time you''ll see it maybe. Thank you for the image.', '2004-03-26 06:34:36.000000', NULL, 0),
