(1918191, 64527, 48991, '<td valign="top">wow, those eyes! The lighting is excellent, hher skin tone compliments her headscarf, and the rich colours are vivid. I think the eyes top of this picture. They animate the ir around them and seem to make hehr headscarf seem alive in colour. Beautiful!!</td>', 'wow, those eyes! The lighting is excellent, hher skin tone compliments her headscarf, and the rich colours are vivid. I think the eyes top of this picture. They animate the ir around them and seem to make hehr headscarf seem alive in colour. Beautiful!!', '2005-12-03 00:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1946917, 64527, 5728, '<td valign="top">Looking at this again after one and a half years, I now find that I don''t like this as much as I did when I submitted it. For one thing the light is too flat and the crop could also have been a lot better. I much prefer this version <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=268764" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5728/thumb/268764.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5728/thumb/268764.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5728/thumb/268764.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Looking at this again after one and a half years, I now find that I don''t like this as much as I did when I submitted it. For one thing the light is too flat and the crop could also have been a lot better. I much prefer this version ', '2005-12-13 11:43:05.000000', NULL, 0),
